<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">Zawsua</book>
  <para style="h">Zawsua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zawsua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zawsua</para>
  <para style="mt">Zawsua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi a thi tawhta, Mawsi baotuhpa Zawsua, Nunâ sawchapawpa hnohta Abeipa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nâ chakaotuhpa Mawsi thi ha ta, chavâta tahmâ thyu la, nâ nata zawpi zydua ta Zawdâh chaka u la, Izarei phopi ei piepa râh lâ sie teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mawsi hnohta bie ei taihpa hawhta, nama phei ta nama tlypa maih ei cha pie khai aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nama râhrizy chho lâta Râhchawhpa tawhta maw lâta Lebanaw taihta châ aw ta, nochhi lâta chavah laipa, Ufrâti chavah tawhta Hiti mo râh zydua ô ta, notla lâta Tilaipi Rônahpa taihta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hro chhôh zydua ahy ta hmah cha pahnie thei aw veih ei. Mawsi hnohta ei ypa hawhna khata, na hnohta ei y hra aw. Cha siesai leipa aw na ta, cha pathlua aw va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thatlôpa nata riahphapa ta y teh. He sahlao he ama pathlatuhpazy hnohta pie awpa ta bie ei taihpa râh cha ryu ta na patosa aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thatlôpa nata riahpha ngaitapa ta y la, nâ chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta tao awpa bie a cha piepa ryhpa zydua pakhâta ta zyh la, tao mah y. Na siena lia maihta thlaochhipa ta na y thei nawpa ta, ryhpa bie he na chachâh lâ tlyma, na chavei lâ tlyma tleisai cheita khah y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ryhpa Châbu heta na pakah a puasai awpa châ leipa ta, a chhôh liata bieropazy chhô nah zâ ta tlao na pachâ awpa a châ. Chatanachata ryhpa biezy cha pakhâta ta na zyh thei aw. Cha hawhta na tao khiahta cha, na lâpizy patlâ aw ta, na hlao a tloh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bie cha pie va na mâ? Thatlôpa nata riahphapa ta y teh. Chi leipa la, ngiarohpa ta y hra kha. Abeipa na Khazohpa cha na siena maihta na hnohta a y lymâ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chatawhcha Zawsua ta Izarei phopi hyutuhpazy biepie ta ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Riehmo chahryh u la, zawpi hnohta, ‘Nama niedozy a chhuanoh teh u. Noh thôh khai tawhta, Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta hnei awpa ta râh a cha piepa ei liata a ngia ta, râh cha hnei awpa ta Zawdâh he nama chaka bâ aw,’ tahpa ta biepie teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rubena mo, Kâdâ mo nata Manase chi khophiezy hnohta Zawsua ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta nama hnohta, ‘ Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta apahâna su cha pie ei ta, he râh he a cha pie aw ei,’ tahpa ta bie a cha piepa ei kha a thei thlâh ha muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nama lapinô zy, nama hawtizy nata nama sahrohzy he Zawdâh hesâ lâ Mawsi ta râh a cha piepa liana ei heta y aw ei ta, nâmo chyhsa thatlô riahphapa sahlao deikua cha, chariah chhaichhi a tobipa ta nama unawhzy hmia lâta Zawdâh chaka aw ei chi ta, nama unawhzy nama bao tua aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abeipa ta nama unawhzy cha, nâmo hawhta apahâna piepa ta, Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta râh a piepa ei cha, âmo chhao ta ama hnei hlâlei bao aw ei chi ta, cha khai tawhta Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta hnei awpa ta Zawdâh nochhi lâta râh a cha piepa lâ ei cha kua aw ei chi ta, râh cha nama hnei aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izarei phopi hyutuhpazy ta Zawsua cha a chhy ei ta, a hnohta, “Tao awpa bie miah na piepa zydua tao aw pi ta, miah na tuana lâ maih eima sie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kyh to liata Mawsi bie eima zyhpa hawhna khata, na bie eima zyh lymâ aw. Abeipa na Khazohpa cha, Mawsi hnohta a ypa hawhna khata, na hnohta y mawh sy!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kheihawhpa biepiepa rai châ sala, ahy rai na biepiepa a dyuhpa nata na biezy a nathlie leipa cha thiepa a châ aw. Thatlôpa nata riahphapa ta y mah y,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua ta mohparutuhpa pano Siti tawhta arulâta tuah ta, ama hnohta, “Sie u la, râh kaw moh u la, a eih pachaipa ta Zerikô khihpi kaw moh muh vy,” tah ta. Mohparutuhpazy cha sie ei ta, Rahâbi ama tahpa âzuahnô o liata a ngia ei ta, cha liata tlô ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chyhsazy ta Zerikô bei hnohta, “Pachâ teh, râh mohparu awpa ta Izarei sawzy tazâ ama kaw tlô,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zerikô bei ta Rahâbi lâ chyhsa tuah ta, a hnohta, “Na o liata a vaw tlôpa khichhaizy kha vaw papua teh. Râh mohparu awpa ta a vaw tlôpa ama châ,” tahpa ta pachhosa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Châhrasala chanô ta mohparutuhpa pano cha a chhi ta, nyu ha ta. Chatanachata ama thâtih a vaw patluahpazy hnohta, “Â do na, kha chyhsazy kha ei o liata vaw tlô tlai ei ta, châhrasala khataih lâ tawhta a vypa ma ama châ tahpa pahno va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaw zoh ta, khihpi thokhy chhikao khaw chy ta, ama pua haw. Khataih lâ ma ama sie tahpa pahno va na. A chadai para u la, nama pha thlâh ha aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rahâbi ta a khichhaizy cha vâphuh lâ a chhi ta, vâphuh liata pala kô a chahypa ry liata nyu ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zerikô bei chyhsazy ta Zawdâh chakana su taihta mohparutuhpazy cha a chadai ei ta. Chadaituhpazy ama puapata nahta, thokhy chhikao khaw ha ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mohparutuhpazy amâ zia hlâta, Rahâbi cha ama yna vâphuh lâ khy ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama hnohta, “He râh he Abeipa ta a cha pie ha ei tahpa ei pahno. Nâmo china ta miah chanaoh ha ta, he râh liata a pahrâpa zydua nama hmiakô liata ama zao khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izi tawhta nama kaw pua nota, Abeipa ta nama hmiakô liata Tilaipi Saihpa a pakuasazie nata Zawdâh haosâ Amawri bei pano Sihaw nata Ôkâ zy chô liata nama taozie zy thei pi ta, âmo cha tlokhuh nama pahleipadia khai hapa thâtihzy eima vaw thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cha thâtih cha eima theipa nahta, Abeipa nama Khazohpa cha chô lâ avâ liata nata a ry lâ alei liata Khazohpa a châpa vâta, eima pathipalôhzy zao khai ha ta, nâmo vâta palôh a pachyu theipa ahy hmah y khao veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chavâta tahmâ Abeipa moh ta bie einâ taih awpa ei chi ta ei châ haw ei. Kei ta nama chô liata ngiachhiena ei palâsapa hawhna heta, nâmo chhao ta ei paw chhôhkha chô liata ngiachhiena palâsa awpa ta bie nâ taih u la, ei lôh thei nawpa ta ngiana na pie teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatanachata ei nô nata ei paw, ei rilâhpazy, ei narôzy nata ama chhôhkha zydua pahlôhpa châ aw ei ta, thina tawhta eima hrona miah nama pachha ha aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mohparutuhpazy ta a hnohta, “Eima hmotaopa he nama reih leipa khiahta cha, eima hrona ta nama hrona cha pachha aw pi ta, eima thipa chhao ta eima thi aw. Abeipa ta râh he miah a pie tita, cha ngiachhie aw pi ta, na chô liata ngâchhih ngaitapa ta eima tao aw,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rahâbi o cha khihpi thokhy pahniehpa ta sapa châ ta, thokhy chô liata a ypa a châpa vâta, chaori pangieh ta, mohparutuhpazy cha opy lâ tawhta pachôsa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama hnohta, “Tlâhpi lâ khi pangaipa ta sie muh vy. Chataleipatala châ chadaituhpazy khata ama cha hmô pathlei aw. Châ chadaituhpazy ama kua heih hlâlei, cha liata noh thôh a nyu chy aw ei chi ta, cha khai tawhta nama sie nawpa lâ nama sie aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mohparutuhpazy ta a hnohta, “Bie miah na pataihsapa tawhna heta thaileichâna hnei aw ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nathlie teh, he râh eimâ vaw ngia tita, pala saihpa he miah na pangiehna opy liana he vaw chahry aw chi ta, na nô nata na paw, na rilâhpazy nata na paw chhôhkha zydua cha na o chhôh liata na paysa khai aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahy rai na o chhikao tawhta khiliah lâ a puapa maih cha, a thisaih maoh ano luh chô liata y aw ta, keimo cha thailei châ aw ma pi. O chhôh liata na hnohta a ypa chô liata ku pathlapa a châ khiahta deikua cha, a thisaih maoh cha eima luh chô liata a y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eima hmotaopa he na reih khiahta deikua cha, bie miah na pataihsapa heta miah chahry leipa aw ta, thailei châ aw ma pi,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ano ta, “Nama bie hawhta châ mawh sy,” tah ta. Chatanachata mohparutuhpazy cha pasiesa ta, sie ha ei ta. Rahâbi ta Pala saihpa ta opy cha chahry ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mohparutuhpazy cha pua ei ta, tlâhpi lâ cha sie ei ta, a vaw chadaipazy ama kua hlâlei, cha liata noh thôh y ei ta. Chadaituhpazy ta lâpi tlykha tlua ei ta, châhrasala hmô leipa ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mohparutuhpa pano cha a lie ei ta. Tlâhpi tawhta za chô ei ta, chavah chaka ei ta, Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua kô kei tlô ei ta, ama chô liata hmo a tlôpa zydua chho ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zawsua hnohta, “ Abeipa ta râh zydua eima ku liata miah a vaw pie ha tlai na. Cha râh liata a pahrâpa zydua keimo vâta ama zao khai haw,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zawsua cha mydi kari ta thyu ta, Izarei saw zydua chhaota Siti tawhta Zawdâh lâ a pasie ei ta. Chavah ama chaka hlâta cha liata a rie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noh thôh a tloh nahta, hyutuhpazy ta riehmo chahryh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zawpizy cha biepie ei ta, ama hnohta, “Theihthaipa Livai chizy ta Abeipa nama Khazohpa Biehrai Byh amâ sypa nama hmôpa nahta, nama yna su tawhta a pasie aw ei chi ta, Byh cha nama pazi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anodeikua nâmo nata Byh likawh liata dy 2,000 rachhôh â hla awpa a châ. Namâ hnia awpa châ vei. Chatanachata nama sie nawpa lâpi cha nama pahno thei aw, kha hlâta he lâpi he a chhih beih tlôh lei khâh ei chi ta,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zawsua ta zawpi hnohta, “A pathai teh u, mylâ Abeipa ta nama hry liata hmonoâhpa a tao aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zawsua ta theihthaipazy hnohta, “Biehrai Byh a sypa ta, zawpi hmia lâta sie u la, Zawdâh chaka teh u,” tah ta. Chatanachata theihthaipazy ta Biehrai Byh cha a sy ei ta, zawpi hmia lâta sie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Mawsi hnohta ei ypa hawhna khata na hnohta chhao ei y aw tahpa ama pahno thei nawpa ta, Izarei saw zydua mohmô liata tanoh tawhta ei cha cheihchalo pathao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biehrai Byh asytuhpa theihthaipazy hnohta, ‘Zawdâh ngiahkâ nama tlô tita, Zawdâh chavah kiah liata a chalihpa ta namâ duah awpa a châ,’ tahpa ta bie na pie aw ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zawsua ta Izarei sawzy hnohta, “He lâ a vy u la, Abeipa nama Khazohpa bie vaw nathlie teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zawsua ta, “He hmozy liana heta Khazoh hrohpa cha nama hry liata y ta, nama hmiakô tawhta Kâna mo, Hiti mo, Hivi mo, Perizi mo, Kirkâsi mo, Amawri mo nata Zebu mozy a papua tlai aw ei tahpa nama pahno aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moh teh u, khizaw zydua Abeipa Biehrai Byh ta nama hmia lâta Zawdâh a chaka hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chi kha tawhta pakha lymâ ta, Izarei chizy hry tawhta chyhsa pahrawh hleino a tlyh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khizaw zydua Abeipa Zehôvâh Byh asytuhpa theihthaipazy pheipazah ta Zawdâh ti a tlypa nahta, machha lâ tawhta Zawdâh chavah ti a zâ lohpazy cha chie pachhôpa ta a toh aw ta, â duah thlâh ha aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatanachata zawpizy cha Zawdâh chaka awpa ta ama poh ozy tawhta pua ei ta, Biehrai Byh asytuhpa theihthaipazy cha zawpi hmia lâta sie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sâh hria daihti chhôh zydua ta Zawdâh chavah cha a kao zydua bie khai ha tyh ta. Byh asytuhpazy Zawdâh kei tlô ei ta, Byh asytuhpa theihthaipazy phei ta ngiahkâ ti a tlypa nahta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />machha lâ tawhta ti a zâ loh haipa cha a duah ta, lâhlapi taihta, Zarethâ kiapâh ta a ypa Âdâh khihpi taihta â sâh pi ta a opa ta a toh ta, Tilaipi Iahpa, Arabâ Tilaipi lâta a lohpa ti cha chie pachhô ta, zawpizy cha Zerikô khih dady liata Zawdâh haosâ lâ ama pua haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Izarei saw zydua ta chavah cha alei hipa liata chaka ei ta, Izarei phopi zydua ta Zawdâh ama chaka khai hlâlei, Abeipa Biehrai Byh asytuhpa theihthaipazy cha Zawdâh chavah liah khophie alei hipa liata a duah thlâh ha ei ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A phopi duata Zawdâh ama chaka khai nahta, Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Chi kha tawhta pakha lymâ ta zawpi hry tawhta chyhsa pahrawh hleino a tlyh aw chi ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama hnohta, ‘Zawdâh liah khophie liata theihthaipazy phei â i ngaitapa ta â duana suzy tawhta alô miahrawh hleino kei la aw ei chi ta, vaw cheih aw ei chi ta, tazâ namâ rie nawpa su liata nama soh aw’, tahpa ta bie na pie aw ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua ta chi kha tawhta pakha lymâ ta, Izarei sawzy hry tawhta chyhsa pahrawh hleino a raopazy cha aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ama hnohta, “ Abeipa nama Khazohpa Byh hmia lâta siepa ta, Zawdâh liah khophie lâ vawh u la, Izarei chi kha châta alô miakha lymâ ta reipatipa ta, alô miakha chyu la u la, nama ngiatlâh ta a vaw pia muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cha cha nama hry liata ngiana a châ aw. Chhâ vaw y awpazy liata nama sawzy ta, ‘He alôzy he khâpa tahna ma a châ tly?’ tahpa ta ama cha hiahri tita,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama hnohta, ‘ Abeipa Biehrai Byh hmiakô liata Zawdâh tizy a chie pachhôpa atheithlâhna a châ. Abeipa Biehrai Byh ta Zawdâh a chaka nota, Zawdâh tizy a chie pachhô haw. Chavâta he alôzy he Izarei sawzy ta, cha thâtih cha chhâzaw ta amâ thei thlâh nawpa châta a châ,’ tahpa ta nama chho aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ta Zawsua biepiepa hawhta tao ei ta. Izarei chi zie ta Zawdâh chavah liah khophie tawhta alô miahrawh hleino la ei ta, ama riehmo lâ cheih ei ta, cha liata soh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Alô miahrawh hleino cha, Zawsua ta Biehrai Byh asytuhpa theihthaipazy aduana su, Zawdâh chavah liah khophie liata bô ta, chazy cha tanoh taihta a y thlâh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mawsi ta Zawsua bie a piepa zydua hawhta, Abeipa ta zawpi tao awpa Zawsua a chhopazy ama tao khai hlâlei, theihthaipazy cha Zawdâh chavah liah khophie liata a duah thlâh ha ei ta. Zawpizy cha a para ngaitapa ta Zawdâh chaka ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama zydua ta haosâ lâ ama kia khai nahta, Abeipa Biehrai Byh nata asytuhpa theihthaipazy cha zawpi hmia lâta sie lymâ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase chi khophiezy chhao, Mawsi ta ama hnohta a reipa hawhta, chariah adyuhna chhaichhi a tobipa ta zawpi hmia lâta sie ei ta, Zawdâh cha chaka ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A dyuh awpa ta a mâ chiehpa pheisaih 40,000 ta Abeipa hmiakô liata Zawdâh cha chaka ei ta, Zerikô bypi lâ ama pangai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha noh liata, Abeipa ta Izarei zydua mohmô ta Zawsua cha cheihchalo ta. Mawsi ama zapa hawhta, Izarei zawpi ta Zawsua cha a hrochhôh zydua ama za lymâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Biehrai Byh asytuhpa theihthaipazy kha Zawdâh chavah tawhta vaw pua awpa ta biepie teh,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zawsua ta theihthaipazy cha biepie ta, “Zawdâh chavah tawhta vaw pua teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chatanachata Abeipa Biehrai Byh asytuhpa theihthaipazy cha Zawdâh chavah liah khophie tawhta vaw pua ei ta, theihthaipazy pheipazah ta alei hipa a tlypa nahta, Zawdâh tizy cha a lo tyhpa hawhta za loh heih ta, a bie tyhpa hawhta a kao zydua a bie khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Izarei phopi cha cha thla khana, noh hrawhna noh ta Zawdâh tawhta pua ei ta, Zerikô nochhi râhri Kilkal liata riehmo paryh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zawdâh tawhta alô miahrawh hleino phaoh ei ta, chazy cha Zawsua ta Kilkal liata bô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zawsua ta Izarei sawzy hnohta, “Chhâ vaw y awpazy liata nama sawzy ta ama pawzy hnohta, ‘He alôzy he khâpa tahna ma a châ tly?’ tahpa ta ama hiahri tita,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Izarei ta alei hipa liata Zawdâh a chakapa atheithlâhna a châ,’ tahpa ta nama chho aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zehôvâh Khazohpa ta eima chaka khai hlâlei Tilaipi Saihpa pakua ta, Tilaipi Saihpa chô liata a taopa hawhna khata, Zehôvâh Khazohpa ta nama chaka khai hlâlei Zawdâh tizy a cha pakuapa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chatanachata alei chô liata phopi zydua ta Abeipa ku cha ku thatlôpa a châ tahpa pahno aw ei ta, Abeipa nama Khazohpa cha nama chi lymâ thei aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izarei sawzy Zawdâh ama chaka khai hlâlei Abeipa ta Izarei sawzy hmiakô liata Zawdâh tizy a pakua tahpa thâtih cha, Zawdâh haosâ notla lâta a ypa Amawri bei zydua nata tilaipi kiah liata a ypa Kâna bei zydua ta ama thei nahta, Izarei sawzy vâta ama pathipalôh zao khaipa ta, ama thlah a hua khai ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cha daihti liata, Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Meilô chaizôh tao la, Izarei sawzy kha ama chopaw a einona ta taipa heih teh,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zawsua ta meilô chaizôhzy tao ta, Izarei sawzy cha Kibia Hârâlôthâ liata ama chopaw taipa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />He he Zawsua ta ama chopaw a taina chhâpa a châ: Izi râh tawhta a kaw puapa chariah adyuhpa chapaw zydua kha, Izi râh tawhta ama pua tawhta râhchawhpa lâpi liata thi khai ha ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izi râh tawhta a kaw puapa zydua cha chopaw tai chiehpa sai châ ei ta, Izi râh tawhta ama kaw pua tawhta râhchawhpa lâpi liata a pihpazy zydua deikua cha, chopawtai leipazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ta Abeipa ao ama nathlie khoh leipa vâta, ama pathlatuhpazy hnohta pie awpa ta Abeipa ta bie â taihpa sâhpiti nata kheihti lona râh pahmôsa lei awpa ta Abeipa ta ama hnohta bie â taih haw. Chatanachata Izi râh tawhta a kaw puapa, chariah a dyuhpa Izarei phopi chapaw zydua ama leidia khai hlâlei, Izarei sawzy cha râhchawhpa liata kô sypalih chhôh ama viavi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta Abeipa ta âmo vyuhpa ta a paduapa ama pathlazy cha Zawsua ta ama chopaw a taipa ei. Lâpi liata ama chopaw taipa a châ leipa vâta chopawtaileipa ta ama vaw y thlâh hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A phopi dua ta chopaw taipa ama châ khai tawhta, ama tlâh hlâlei cha ama riehmo chyu liata y chy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Tanoh he Izi mo ama cha mohnaona nâmo tawhta ei pahlei haw,” tah ta. Chavâta cha su cha tahmâ taihta Kilkal tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izarei sawzy cha Kilkal liata riehmo paryh ei ta, cha thla, noh hrawh hleipalihna noh zâlâ ta Zerikô bypizy liata zawpakhô ama chay.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zawpakhô mylâ ta, cha râh liata a papuapa viahchhâ thinô pahlao leipa nata chhâmeih raopazy nie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Râh liata a papuapa ama nie noh a mylâ tawhta cha, mânâ tla khao leipa ta, Izarei sawzy châta mânâ y khao vei. Cha kô tawhta cha Kâna râh chhaohlei thei ama nie pathao haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zawsua cha Zerikô khihpi kiapâh liata a y nota, mohmia pasaih ta, a hmiakô liata chyhsa pakha, zaozi a paih tawhta phia chiehpa a chabapa ta a vaw duah thlâh ha ta. Zawsua ta kei pangai ta, a hnohta, “Keimo chhâh a châpa ma na châ, eima khakhaipazy chhâh a châpa chi maw?” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chyhsa chata, “Châ vei, Abeipa pheisaihzy hyutuhpa ei châ. Tahmâ ei vy haw,” tah ta. Chatawhcha Zawsua cha alei liata â khu lâta pao ta, Abeipa pheisaihzy hyutuhpa cha a chhy ta, a hnohta, “Ei zibeipa ta a chakaotuhpa hnohta khâpa ma rei awpa a hnei tly?” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abeipa pheisaihzy hyutuhpa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Na pheiky kha pahluh teh. Nâ duana su kha su pathaihpa a châ,” tah ta. Cha hawhna chata Zawsua ta a pheiky cha pahluh ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izarei sawzy vâta Zerikô khihpi cha a chhôh lâ chhao khôtho lâ chhao khaw khaipa châ ta, ahy hmah pua leipa ei ta, ahy hmah a ngia hra veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Moh teh, Zerikô khihpi cha a khih bei nata a chyhsa thatlô riahphapazy chhaota na ku liata ei cha pie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pheisaih zydua ta khihpi cha ei kha chahlô tua aw ei chi ta, cha hawhna chata noh charu chhôh nama tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Theihthaipa pasari ta Byh hmia lâta mietaku tôhpa ki chiahmie miasari chaba aw ei ta, noh sarina noh ta khihpi cha ei sari chahlô aw ei chi ta, theihthaipazy ta chiahmie cha ama tô aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mietaku tôhpa ki cha ao pasipa ta tô aw ei ta, chiahmie pyu nama theipa nahta, zawpi zydua ao paro ngaitapa ta awh aw ei chi ta, chatanachata khihpi thokhy cha cho aw ta, zawpizy cha âmo dady chyu liata khihpi chhôh lâ amâ ngia aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua ta theihthaipazy aw ta, ama hnohta, “Biehrai Byh he a sy u la, theihthaipa pasari ta Abeipa Byh hmia lâta mietaku tôhpa ki chiahmie miasari chabapa ta ama sie aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zawsua ta zawpi hnohta, “Sie lymâ u la, khihpi cha chahlô teh u. Chariah chhaichhi a tobipa pheisaihzy cha Abeipa Byh hmia lâta sie mawh ei sy,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zawsua ta zawpi hnohta bie a rei khai nahta, Abeipa hmiakô liata mietaku tôhpa ki chiahmie miasari a chabapa theihthaipa pasarizy cha, chiahmie tôna chôta sie lymâ ei ta, Abeipa Biehrai Byh ta âmo cha pazi ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chariah chhaichhi a tobipa pheisaihzy cha chiahmie tôtuhpa theihthaipazy hmia lâta sie ei ta, hnôh lâta vaituhpazy ta Byh cha pazi ei ta, theihthaipazy ta chiahmie cha â zaopa ta tô lymâ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zawsua ta zawpi hnohta, “Awh awpa ta ei cha chho hlâlei ei cha, awh leipa u la, nama ao chhao theipa châ leipa sala, nama pakah tawhta bie rai pua khah sy. Awh awpa ta ei cha chho ti ei ta nama awh aw,” tahpa ta biepie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatanachata Abeipa Byh cha khihpi ei kha chahlôsa ta, cha khai tawhta riehmo lâ a di ei ta, cha liata a rie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zawsua cha mydi kari ta thyu ta, theihthaipazy ta Abeipa Byh cha a sy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mietaku tôhpa ki chiahmie miasari a chabapa theihthaipa pasarizy cha, Abeipa Byh hmia lâta sie ei ta, â zaopa ta chiahmie tô ei ta. Chariah chhaichhi a tobipa pheisaihzy âmo hmia lâta sie ei ta, hnôh lâta vaituhpazy ta Abeipa Byh pazi ei ta, theihthaipazy ta â zaopa ta chiahmie tô ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Noh nona liata khihpi cha ei kha chahlô heih ei ta, riehmo lâ kua heih ei ta. Cha hawhna chata noh charu tao ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Noh sarina noh ta khih a deipa nahta thyu ei ta, ama tao tyhpa hawhta khihpi cha chahlô heih ei ta. Cha noh liata cha ei sari tlai chahlô ei ta, cha noh lia dei ta khihpi cha ei sari ama chahlôpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ei sarina ama chahlô nahta, theihthaipazy ta chiahmie tô ei ta, Zawsua ta zawpi hnohta, “Awh teh u, Abeipa ta khihpi he a cha pie ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khihpi he a chhôh liata a ypa zydua chhaota Abeipa lâ hlâ ta, parao khai awpa a châ. Âzuahnô Rahâbi deikua cha, eima tuapa lyuhchâpazy a vaw nyupa vâta, ano nata a o liata a ypa zydua pahlôh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pahleipadia awpa hmo kheihawhpa hmah namâ la awpa châ vei. Pahleipadia awpa hmozy namâ la khiahta cha, nâmosasyh ta nama chô liata chhiesana patlôsa aw ei chi ta, Izarei riehmo chhiesapa ta tao aw ei chi ta, nôpopa ta nama soh pathlei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tâkâ, ngôh, dawh nata thua hmobaohzy deikua cha, Abeipa châta châ khai aw ta, Abeipa sôh o liata so awpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chiahmie pyu a paro nahta, zawpizy cha awh ei ta. Chiahmie pyu ama theipata nahta, zawpizy cha thata awh ei ta, chatanachata thokhy cha cho ta, a phia ta alei liata a pao haw. Chatawhcha zawpizy cha âmo dady chyu ta Khihpi chhôh lâ a ngia ei ta, khihpi cha la ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khihpi liata a ypa zydua, chanô chapaw, hawti machâ, viahchao, mietaku nata alâ zy zaozi ta ama thie khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Râh mohparutuhpa chyhsa pano hnohna khata Zawsua ta, “Âzuahnô o liana hao a kei ngia u la, a hnohta bie namâ taihpa hawhna khata, a chhôhkha zydua chhaota puakhei teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mohparutuhpa satliazy cha a kei ngia ei ta, Rahâbi cha a nô nata a paw nata a rilâhpazy nata a chhôhkha zydua chhaota puakhei ei ta, Izarei riehmo khôtho liata ama paysa haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khihpi cha a chhôh liata a ypa zydua chhaota mei ta rao ei ta, tâkâ, ngôh, dawh nata thua hmobaohzy deita Abeipa o sôh sona liata soh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Âzuahnô Rahâbi nata a paw chhôhkha nata a hneipa zydua deikua cha, Zawsua ta pahlôh khai ta. Rahâbi deikua cha, Zawsua ta Zerikô khihpi mohparu awpa ta a tuapa lyuhchâpazy a vaw nyupa vâta, tanoh taihta Izarei hry liata a pahrâ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cha daihti liata, Zawsua ta zawpi cha chhie sakhâh ta, “Thyu ta, he Zerikô khihpi a paduapathipa maih cha Abeipa hmiakô liata chhiesapa ta y mawh sy. “A sawchapaw uhtheipa hrona ta Khihpi abôna lô bô sala, A sawchapaw seihnaipa hrona ta A chhikaozy padua mawh sy,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abeipa cha Zawsua hnohta y ta, râh zydua liata a moh pathâh ha ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Châhrasala Izarei sawzy ta pahleipadia awpa hmozy kyh liata hmo parao ei ta. Zudâh chi Zerâ sawchapawpa Zabidi, Zabidi sawchapawpa Kâmi, Kâmi sawchapawpa Âkhâ ta pahleipadia awpa hmo vaw la ha ta. Chavâta Abeipa cha Izarei sawzy chô liata a pathi ia ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zawsua ta Zerikô khihpi tawhta Bethel nochhi lâ Bethave kiapâh liata a ypa Ai khihpi lâ chyhsa tuah ta, ama hnohta, “Khy u la, râh kaw mohparu teh u,” tah ta. Chyhsazy cha khy ei ta, Ai khihpi cha kaw mohparu ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zawsua lâ zâ lie ei ta, a hnohta, “Chyhsa zydua khy hlei khah ei sy. Chyhsa sâh no tlyma, sâh thôh tlyma khy ei sala, Ai khihpi cha a kaw dyuh mawh ei sy. Ai khihpi cha maluh chyhta dei châ ei ta, chavâta chyhsa zydua rie pathei awpa byuh vei,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chatanachata zawpi hry tawhta chyhsa sâh thôh rachhôh khy ei ta, châhrasala Ai khihsawzy hmiakô liata amâ râpai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ai chyhsazy ta Izarei chyhsa sythôh nata pacharu thie ei ta, thokhy chhikao tawhta Sebari taihta a chadai ei ta. Chhutla ama chô nota thie ei ta, zawpizy palôh ti hawhta a zao khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zawsua cha a chysiazy hrie ta, ano nata Izarei machâzy cha, Abeipa Byh hmiakô liata zâlâ taih â khu lâta alei liata pao ei ta, ama luh liata buchâh mia ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zawsua ta, “Hy Abeipa Zehôvâh, Amawri mo ku liata miah hlâ ta thie awpa ta ma, he phopi he Zawdâh miah na vaw chakakhei? Zawdâh haosâ liata pahrâ awpa ta palôh a vaw patlâh thlâh ha sih la a pha via awpa tlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hy Abeipa, rei theipa khâpa ei hnei khao? Izarei cha a chariahpazy ta ama pahnie ha he zaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha thâtih cha Kâna mo nata a râh liata a pahrâpa zydua ta thei aw ei ta, miah dôh aw ei ta, alei chô tawhta eima moh ama pahlei ha aw he zaw! Chata a châ khiahta cha, na moh rônahpa pabohsa awpa ta kheihta ma na tao khao aw?” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Thyu teh! Khazia nâ khu thlâh haw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izarei ta hmo a parao haw. Ama hnohta bie ei piepa, ei biehrai parao ei ta, pahleipadia awpa hmo thokha amâ la haw. Hmo paru ei ta, haipa bie reih ei ta, ama parupazy cha ama hmo hry liata ama nyu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chavâta Izarei sawzy cha ama chariahzy hmiakô liata a duah thei khao veih ei. Ama chariahzy hmiakô tawhta a râpai ei ta, âmo chhao pahleipadia awpa ta raopa ama châ. Chavâta pahleipadia awpa hmozy cha nama hry tawhtapa nama pahleipadia leipa khiahta cha, nama hnohta y khao aw va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thyu teh! Zawpi kha pathaisa la, ama hnohta, ‘Mylâ châta a pathai teh u. Abeipa , Izarei Khazohpa ta hetana heta a tah: “Hy Izarei, pahleipadia awpa hmozy nama hry liata y ta, chazy cha nama hry tawhta nama pahleipadia hlâlei nama chariahzy hmiakô liata a duah thei aw veih ei chi,”’ tah teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />My ta a chi chi ta a vaw luah aw ei chi ta, Abeipa ta chi a chakhipa tawhta a pho pho ta a vaw luah aw ei chi ta, Abeipa ta pho a chakhipa tawhta a chhôh chhôh ta a vaw luah aw ei chi ta, Abeipa ta a chakhipa chhôh tawhta pawhrâhpa pakha pakha ta namâ vaw luah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahy rai châ sala, pahleipadia awpa hmo a hnohta hmôpa a châ khiahta cha, Abeipa biehrai parao ta, Izarei liata hmo pha lei ngaitapa a taopa vâta, cha chyhsa cha, a chhôhkha nata a hneipa zydua chhaota mei ta rao awpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zawsua cha mydi ta thyu ta, Izarei cha a chi chi ta vaw paluahsa ta, Zudâh chi chakhipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zudâh chi cha a pho pho ta vaw paluahsa ta, Zerâ pho chakhipa a châ. Zerâ pho cha a chhôh chhôh ta vaw paluahsa ta, Zabidi chhôh chakhipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zibidi chhôh pawhrâhpazy cha pakha pakha ta vaw paluahsa ta, Zudâh chi Zerâ sawchapawpa Zabidi, Zabidi sawchapawpa Kâmi, Kâmi sawchapawpa Âkhâ cha chakhipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zawsua ta Âkhâ hnohta, “Ei sawchapawpa, Abeipa Izarei Khazohpa parônahsa la, a hnohta a phuah teh. Khâpa hmo ma na tao tahpa na chho la, na phih khah y,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Âkhâ ta Zawsua cha a chhy ta, a hnohta, “Zehôvah, Izarei Khazohpa chô liata hmo ei vaw parao ha tlai. He he ei hmotaopa cha a châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hraona sôhzy hry liata Sinâ poh pha ngaitapa nata tâkâ sekel za no nata ngôh tlo sekel sypangawh a hripa hmô na ta, ei hia na tlia ngaita ta, ei vaw la haw. Ei poh o chhôh liata alei ry liata nyu na ta, a ry chai liata tâkâ a y,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zawsua ta lyuhchâpazy tuah ta, poh o lâ cha a râ ei ta, hraona sôhzy cha a poh o liata nyupa châ ta, a ry chai liata tâkâ vaw y thlâh ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hraona sôhzy cha poh o chhôh tawhta la ei ta, Zawsua nata Izarei saw zydua lâta vaw cheih ei ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata soh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zawsua nata Izarei saw zydua ta Zerâ sawchapawpa Âkhâ cha tâkâ, poh, ngôh tlo, a sawchapawzy, a sawchanôzy, a viahchaozy, a alâzy, a mietakuzy, a poh o nata a hneipa zydua chhaota a chhipa ta, Akhôrâ Saikao lâ khykhei ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zawsua ta, “Khazia nôpopa ta miah na paysa? Nâ chhao tanoh he Abeipa ta nôpopa ta a cha paysa aw,” tah ta. Chatanachata Âkhâ cha Izarei saw zydua ta alô ta vawhsao ei ta. A chhôhkhazy chhao vawhsao ei ta, ama vawhsao khai tawhta mei ta rao ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A chô liata alô hluhpi pacho thlu ei ta, cha cha tanoh taihta a y thlâh haw. Chatanachata Abeipa cha a pathiiana ru ngaitapa tawhta â palie haw. Chavâta cha su cha tanoh taihta Akhôrâ Saikao tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Chi leipa la, thlazohpa ta y hra khah y. Adyuhna lâ a sie thei awpa chyhsa zydua na hnohta a chhi la, thyu la, Ai khihpi lâ sie teh. Pachâ teh, Ai khih bei nata a chyhsazy, a khihpi nata a râh na ku liata ei cha pie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zerikô nata a khih bei chô liata na taopa hawhna khata, Ai khihpi nata a khih bei chô liata chhao na tao aw. Ai khihpi liata deikua cha hraona nata sahrohzy namâ la thei aw. Khihpi cha a hnôh lâ tawhta namâ byh aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua nata pheisaih zydua cha Ai khihpi a dyuh awpa ta pua ei ta. Zawsua ta chyhsa thatlô riahphapa 30,000 a tlyh ta, âmo cha zâ ta pasiesa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama hnohta, “Nathlie teh u, khihpi cha a hnôh lâ tawhta namâ byh aw. Khihpi tawhta â hlapi ta y leipa aw ei chi ta, nama zydua ta amâ chiehpa ta nama y awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei nata ei hnohta a ypa pheisaih zydua ta khihpi cha a vaw hnia aw pi ta, a hmiatuapa liata ama taopa hawhna khata miah a dyuh awpa ta vaw pua aw ei ta, ama hmiakô liata eimâ vaw râpai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miah a vaw chadai aw ei ta, khihpi tawhta â hlapi taih eimâ chadaisa aw. Âmo ta, ‘A hmiatuapa hawhna khata eima hmiakô liata amâ râpai ha heih hih,’ ama tah aw. Cha hawhna chata ama hmiakô liata eimâ vaw râpai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatawhcha namâ byhna su tawhta vaw pua aw ei chi ta, khihpi cha nama chho aw. Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta nama ku liata a cha pie aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khihpi nama lapa nahta, khihpi cha mei ta nama tô aw. Abeipa bie hawhta nama tao awpa a châ. Pachâ teh u, bie ei cha pie ei hih,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chatawhcha Zawsua ta âmo cha pasiesa ta. Abyhna su lâ cha sie ei ta, Ai khihpi notla lâta Bethel nata Ai likawh liata y ei ta. Zawsua deikua cha, cha zâ cha zawpizy hnohta a rie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zawsua cha mydi kari ta thyu ta, zawpi awpakhy ta, ano nata lzarei machâzy cha Ai khihpi pangaipa ta zawpi hmia lâta sie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hnohta a ypa pheisaih zydua khy ei ta, khihpi cha a kaw hnia ei ta, Ai khihpi maw lâ chhâh ta riehmo paryh ei ta. Ai khihpi nata ama likawh liata saikao y ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pheisaih 5,000 a chhi ta, khihpi notla lâ chhâh Bethel nata Ai likawh liata pabyhsa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khihpi maw lâta riehmo supipa liata a ypa pheisaihzy nata notla lâta a byhpa pheisaihzy cha, ama yna su chyu liata a phapa ta a paryh ei ta. Zawsua deikua, cha zâ cha saikao liata a rie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ai khih bei ta Izarei pheisaihzy cha a hmô nahta, ano nata a khihsawzy cha a parapa ta mydi ta thyu ei ta, Arabâ dady su raopa liata Izarei a dyuh awpa ta pua ei ta. Châhrasala khihpi hnôh lâ tawhta amâ vaw byhpa pahno leipa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zawsua nata Izarei saw zydua cha panawh hapa hawhta y pakhei ei ta, râhchawhpa lâpi lâta a râ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khihpi liata a ypa zydua Izarei sawzy a chadai awpa ta a awpakhy ei ta. Zawsua cha a chadai ei ta, khihpi tawhta lâhlapi taih a chadai ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ai nata Bethel khihpizy liata Izarei sawzy achadaina lâ a pua leipa chapaw pakha hmah y veih ei. Khihpi khaw leipa ta puasaipa ta Izarei sawzy cha a chadai ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chatawhcha Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Asei nâ chabapa kha Ai khihpi lâ dypa ta hy teh. Khihpi cha na ku liata ei cha pie aw,” tah ta. Zawsua ta asei â chabapa cha khihpi lâ dypa ta hy ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abyhtuhpazy ta ama yna tawhta thlai vaw thyu ei ta, Zawsua ta a ku a pazawhpa nahta, a râ ei ta, khihpi liata a ngia ei ta. Khihpi cha la ei ta, mei ta thlai ama rao pâ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ai chyhsazy cha hnoh lâ a heih ei ta, khihpi cha avâ lâta a khuh â charih haipa hmô ei ta. Râhchawhpa lâta a râpa Izarei sawzy ta âmo a chadaituhpa Ai chyhsazy cha amâ vaw lie hnao hapa vâta, Ai chyhsazy cha khataih lâ hmah a râ nawpa hnei khao veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abyhtuhpazy ta khihpi cha la ei ta, khihpi meikhuh â charih haipa cha Zawsua nata Izarei saw zydua ta ama hmô nahta, a lie ei ta, âmo a vaw chadaipa Ai chyhsazy cha thie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khihpi a latuhpa Izarei pheisaihzy chhao, khihpi tawhta vaw pua ei ta, Ai chyhsazy cha a dyuh ei ta. Izarei pheisaihzy ta Ai chyhsazy cha dôh ei ta, thokha he lâ y ei ta, thokha hao lâ y ei ta. Izarei pheisaihzy ta Ai chyhsazy cha thie ei ta, ahrohpa tlyma, arâpa tlyma, pakha hmah y veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ai khih bei cha ahrohpa ta patu ei ta, Zawsua lâ a vaw chhi ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ta Ai khihpi chyhsa zydua cha amâ vaw chadaina lyurâhpa nata râhchawhpa suzy liata thie ei ta, ama zydua ta zaozi ta ama thie khai nahta, Izarei saw zydua cha Ai khihpi lâ a lie ei ta, khihpi chhôh liata a ypazy cha zaozi ta thie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cha noh liata a thipa Ai chyhsa zydua cha chanô chapaw ta 12,000 ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ai khihpi chyhsa zydua a pahleipadia khai hlâlei, Zawsua ta asei chabapa ta a ku a pazawhpa pathla vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta bie a piepa hawhta, khihpi liata sahroh nata hmo a ypazy deita Izarei sawzy ta hraona sôh ta amâ la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zawsua ta Ai khihpi cha mei ta rao ta, chhâzaw ta alei byuhpa ta y awpa ta tao ta, tanoh taihta roryhrapa ta a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ai khih bei cha zâlâ taih thokô liata pangieh ta, noh a tla nahta Zawsua ta biepie ta, a ri cha thokô tawhta la ei ta, khihpi angiana thokhy chhikao liata thy ei ta, a chô liata alô hluhpi pacho thlu ei ta, cha cha tanoh taihta a y thlâh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chatawhcha Zawsua ta Ebâ Tlâh liata Abeipa Izarei Khazohpa châta maisâh tao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta Izarei sawzy hnohta bie a piepa, Mawsi ryhpa châbu liata ropa hawhta, alô khai leipa, ahy ta hmah thua chaihrai ama hmâ thlu leipa alô ta maisâh cha a tao. Cha liata Abeipa lâta raopa hlânazy hlâ ei ta, aryhna hlâna atheihnazy chhao ama hlâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cha liata, Izarei sawzy mohmô lia tlai ta, Mawsi ro chaneipa ryhpa kha Zawsua ta alôzy liata roh pachhuah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chatawhcha Izarei zydua, chihropa chhao, a râh chyhsa chhao, ama machâzy nata hyutuhpazy nata ama ryureituhpazy chhaota Abeipa Biehrai Byh asytuhpa Livai chi theihthaipazy hmiakô liata, Byh hiakha lâ nata hiakha lâ liata a duah ei ta. Â khophie Kerizi Tlâh hmia liata a duah ei ta, a khophie Ebâ Tlâh hmia liata a duah ei ta. Cha cha Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta Izarei chyhsazy byhnâ awpa awpa ta Zawsua hnohta bie a vaw piepa hawhta taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta Zawsua ta ryhpa bie zydua, byhnâ awna nata chhiesana biezy cha, Ryhpa Châbu liata ropa hawhta reih khai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mawsi biepiepa zydua kha Zawsua ta Izarei zawpi zydua hnohta a rei leipa y vei. Chanôzy nata hawtizy nata ama hry liata chihropa a ypazy hnohta Zawsua ta a rei leipa ryhpa bie miakha hmah y vei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zawdâh haosâ tlâh râh nata bypi nata Tilaipi Laipa ngiahkâ zydua liata Lebanaw taihta a ypa bei zydua, Hiti bei, Amawri bei, Kâna bei, Perizi bei, Hivi bei nata Zebu beizy ta Izarei sawzy thâtih ama thei nahta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />â raohpa ta Zawsua nata Izarei a dyuh awpa ta a hmaohpakhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Châhrasala Kibiô khihsawzy ta Zerikô nata Ai khihpizy chô liata Zawsua hmotaopazy ama thei nahta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />piehpiepa ta hmotao ei ta. Sykhao nata kresawhti savo titheih chy karaopa, ahriepa nata baithlapazy ama alâzy paphaosa ei ta, lyuhchâpa hawhta a taopa ta Zawsua a kei tyh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pheiky chypa baithlapazy a ky ei ta, chysia parohpa ta a tobi ei ta, nie awpa ta amâ phaopa viahchhâzy chhao a chawhkaraipa nata a maohpazy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatanachata Kilkal liata riehmo paryhpa liata a ypa Zawsua lâ vawh ei ta, ano nata Izarei chyhsazy hnohta, “Râh hlapi tawhta a vypa châ pi ta, chavâta eima hnohta aryhna bie hraih teh u,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Izarei chyhsazy ta Hivi mo hnohta, “Eima hry liata a pahrâ hrapa nama châ thei mâh tâh. Kheihta ma nama hnohta aryhna bie eima hraih thei aw?” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Âmo ta Zawsua hnohta, “Châ chakaotuhpazy eima châ,” tah ei ta. Zawsua ta ama hnohta, “Ahyzy ma nama châ? Khataih lâ tawhta a vypa ma nama châ?” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Âmo ta a hnohta, “Châ chakaotuhpazy he Abeipa na Khazohpa moh vâta râh hlapi tawhta a vypa eima châ. A thâtih vaw thei pi ta, Izi râh liata a hmotaopa zydua nata
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zawdâh haosâ liata Amawri bei pano, Hesbaw bei Sihaw nata Astarô liata a ypa Bâsanâ bei Ôkâ chô liata a hmotaopa zydua eima thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chavâta eima machâzy nata eima râh chyhsa zydua ta eima hnohta, ‘Lâpi liata nie awpazy a phaopa ta, âmo a tyh awpa ta sie aw ei chi ta, ama hnohta, “Châ chakaotuhpazy eima châ. Eima hnohta aryhna bie hraih teh u,” nama tah aw,’ tahpa ta miah ama chho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nâmo lâ a vy awpa ta eima o tawhta eima vaw pua nota, eima viahchhâzy he a sah hôlôpa ta a vaw phao pi ta, châhrasala tahmâ cha moh tua u, chawhkarai khai ha ta, a maoh khai ha hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kresawhti savo titheihzy chhao he, eima ryh nota cha a thiehpa châ ei ta, moh tua u, a pyu khai ha hih. Eima chysia nata eima pheikyzy chhao, eima vaw siena â hla kawpa vâta ama chy khai ha hih,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ta viahchhâ cha nie pachhi ei ta, Abeipa pachâna deikua hiahri tua veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua ta âmo nata aryhna tao ta, pahlôh awpa ei ta ama hnohta bie hraih ta, zawpi hyutuhpazy chhao ta ama hnohta bie a taih ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kibiô mo hnohta aryhna biehrai a tao tawhta noh thôh a châ nahta, ama chheipâh liata a ypa châ ei ta, ama hry liata a pahrâpa ama châpa pahno ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Izarei sawzy cha sie lymâ ei ta, noh thôhna noh ta Kibiô mo khihpizy kei tlô ei ta. Ama khihpizy cha Kibiô, Kephirâh, Berô nata Kiriaziari zy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izarei zawpi hyutuhpazy ta Abeipa , Izarei Khazohpa moh reipa ta ama hnohta bie amâ vaw taih hapa vâta, Izarei sawzy ta Kibiô mo cha thie veih ei. Cha kyh liata zawpi zydua ta hyutuhpazy chô liata paphôh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hyutuhpazy ta zawpi zydua hnohta, “Zehôvah, Izarei Khazohpa moh reipa ta ama hnohta bie a vaw taih ha pi ta, chavâta âmo cha hria hraoh ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hetana heta ama chô liata tao sih la, pahlôh thlâh ha suh u. Chataleipatala ama hnohta bie a vaw taih ha tlôh pi ta, eima chô liata Abeipa hiehâhna a vaw tlô pathlei aw na,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hyutuhpazy ta, “Pahlôh thlâh ha suh u. Anodeikua zawpizy châta tho pakhytuhpa nata ti thaihtuhpa ta ama y aw,” tah ei ta. Chatanachata hyutuhpazy reipa hawhta tao ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zawsua ta Kibiô mo cha aw ta, ama hnohta, “Khazia eima hry liata a pahrâpa nama châpa tlai ta, ‘Lâhlapi tawhta a vypa na eima châ,’ tahpa ta miah nama dôvei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chavâta chhiesapa nama châ haw. Sei châ kôzaw aw ei chi ta, ei Khazohpa o châta tho pakhytuhpa nata ti thaihtuhpa ta nama y lymâ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Âmo ta Zawsua cha a chhy ei ta, “Râh zydua he nâmo cha pie awpa nata râh liata a pahrâpa zydua nama hmiakô tawhta pahleipadia khai awpa ta, Abeipa na Khazohpa ta a chakaotuhpa Mawsi hnohta bie a pie tahpa a sia ngaitapa ta pahno pi ta, nâmo vâta eima hrona pahlei awpa eima chi ngaita. Chavâta kha hawhta eima taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moh teh, tahmâ na ku liata eima y hih. A phapa nata â dopa ta na pahnopa hawhta eima chô liata tao mah y,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua ta pha a tahnazie hawhta tao ta, âmo cha Izarei sawzy ku tawhta pachha ta, Izarei sawzy ta thie khao veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cha noh ta Zawsua ta Kibiô mo cha zawpi châta nata Abeipa ta a maisâh y nawpa ta a raopa su châta tho pakhy awpa nata ti thaih awpa ta rao ta, cha hawhna chata tanoh taihta ama y.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zerusale bei Adônizede ta Zawsua ta Ai khihpi la ta, parao khai ta, Zerikô nata a khih bei a paraopa hawhta, Ai khihpi nata a khih bei chhao a parao khai hapa thâtih thei ta. Kibiô khihsawzy cha Izarei nata aryhna biehrai tao ei ta, Izarei hry liata ama pahrâ hapa thâtih chhao thei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chavâta chi ngaita ta. Kibiô cha khihpi lai ngaitapa, bei khihpi hawhpa châ ta. Ai khihpi hlâta lai via ta, a khihsaw chapaw zydua chhao pasaipha sai châ ei ta, chatanachôta Izarei nata aryhna a taopa vâta, Zerusale bei cha a chi ngaitapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chavâta Zerusale bei Adônizede ta Hebraw bei Hôhâ, Zarâmu bei Pirâ, Lakhi bei Zaphia nata Ekalaw bei Debi zy lâ chyhsa tuah ta, ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“A khy u la, na kaw bao teh u, Kibiô a dyuh ei suh u. Zawsua nata Izarei sawzy nata aryhna a tao ha hih,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chatanachata Amawri bei papangawh, Zerusale bei, Hebraw bei, Zarâmu bei, Lakhi bei nata Ekalaw beizy cha a paraoh ei ta, ama pheisaih zydua chhaota khy ei ta, Kibiô khihpi riaai liata a pahmaoh ei ta, khihpi cha a dyuh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kibiô mo ta Kilkal riehmo liata a ypa Zawsua lâ chyhsa tuah ei ta, a hnohta, “Châ chakaotuhpazy he na bâh pathliah sai khah y. A chatliepa ta keimo lâ a khy la, miah kaw bao la, miah kaw pachha mah y. Tlâh râh liata a pahrâpa Amawri bei zydua a paraoh ei ta miah amâ dyuh hih,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua cha a pheisaih thatlôpa nata riahphapa zydua chhaota Kilkal tawhta khy ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Kha chyhsazy kha chi khah y. Âmo cha na ku liata ei cha pie haw. Na hmiakô liata a duah thei awpa ama hry liata pakha hmah y aw veih ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zawsua cha azozâkhihdei ta Kilkal tawhta sie ta, eikhapi ta Amawri mo cha tla thlu ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abeipa ta Izarei sawzy hmiakô liata Amawri mo cha patypamâsa ta, Kibiô liata thata thie ei ta, Behôrô lâ khyna lâpi lâta a chadai ei ta, Azekâ nata Mâkedâ khihpi taihta thie lymâ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izarei sawzy hmiakô tawhta a râpai ei ta, Behôrô chhutla ama chô hai nota, Abeipa ta avâ tawhta pareih laipa za patlasa ta, Azekâ tlôna taihta âmo cha daih lymâ ta, thata thi ei ta. Izarei sawzy ta zaozi ta ama thiepazy hlâ chhao ta pareih ta a daisaopa ama hluh via.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abeipa ta Izarei sawzy ku liata Amawri mo a pie noh ta, Zawsua ta Abeipa bie a chho ta, Izarei sawzy mohmô liata, “Noh y, Kibiô chô liata a duah la, Thlâpâ y, Aizalô saikao chô liata a duah mah y,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chatanachata râh ta a chariahpazy chô liata phuh a la khai hlâlei cha, Noh a duah ta, Thlâpâ chhao â chalih haw. He biezy he Zasâh châbu liata ropa a châ. Noh cha avâ liah khophie liata a duah ta, noh kha bohloh tlai tla leipa ta a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha hawhta Abeipa ta chyhsapa ao a nathliena noh cha, cha hlâta y beih leipa ta, cha khai tawhta chhao y beih khao vei. Abeipa ta Izarei â dyuhkheipa vâta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta Zawsua nata Izarei saw zydua cha Kilkal liata ama riehmo lâ a lie ha ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bei papangawhzy cha a râ ei ta, Mâkedâ lôpu liata a nyu ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zawsua hnohta, “Bei papangawhzy cha ama hmô haw. Mâkedâ lôpu liata amâ nyu,” tahpa ta chho ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zawsua ta ama hnohta, “Lôpu paka cha alô laipazy ta pamai u la, vaituhpazy soh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nâmo deikua cha, cha liata y khuh vy. Nama chariahzy a chadai u la, hnôh a chhâhpazy tawhta thie lymâ u la, ama khihpizy pangiasa khuh vy. Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta âmo cha nama ku liata a cha pie ha ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zawsua nata Izarei sawzy ta ama chariahzy cha amâ mua khaina taihta thie ei ta. A laibâhpa chyhtazy deikua cha thokhy hneipa khihpizy lâ a râ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chatanachata zawpi zydua cha Mâkedâ liata a ypa Zawsua lâ thlalôhpa ta a lie ei ta. Izarei sawzy chô liata a reih a pathlie ngâhpa ahy hmah y khao veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zawsua ta, “Lôpu paka kha pahy u la, bei papangawhzy kha ei hnohta a vaw chhi teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata tao ei ta, bei papangawh, Zerusale bei, Hebraw bei, Zarâmu bei, Lakhi bei nata Ekalaw beizy cha lôpu tawhta Zawsua lâ a vaw chhi ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Beizy cha Zawsua kô ama vaw tlôkhei nahta, Zawsua ta Izarei chapaw zydua awpakhy ta, a hnohta a sie hrapa pheisaih hyutuhpazy hnohta, “A vaw hnia u la, he beizy rao he vaw tly teh u,” tah ta. A vaw hnia ei ta, beizy rao cha tly ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zawsua ta ama hnohta, “Chi leipa u la, riahchhiepa ta y hra leipa u la, thatlôpa nata riahphapa ta y teh u. He hawhna heta Abeipa ta namâ dyuhpa nama chariahpa zydua chô liata a tao lymâ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta Zawsua ta bei papangawhzy cha chhawh ta, thie ta, thokô miapangawh liata pangieh ta. Zâlâ taih thokô liata a bangieh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Noh a tla nahta, Zawsua ta biepie ta, thokô tawhta la ei ta, amâ nyuna lôpu liata thy ei ta, lôpu paka cha alô laipazy ta pamai ei ta, cha hawhna chata tanoh taihta a y thlâh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cha noh ta Zawsua ta Mâkedâ khihpi cha la ta. Khihsawzy nata ama khih bei cha zaozi ta thie ta, cha khihpi liata a ypa zydua pamo khai ta, pakha hmah pahlôh vei. Zerikô bei chô liata a taopa hawhta, Mâkedâ bei chô liata chhao tao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zawsua cha a hnohta a ypa Izarei saw zydua chhaota Mâkedâ tawhta Libnâ khihpi lâ sie ta, khihpi cha a dyuh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Abeipa ta Libnâ cha a khih bei chhaota Izarei ku liata pie ta. Khihpi cha a dyuh ta, a chhôh liata a ypa chyhsa zydua cha zaozi ta thie khai ta, chyhsa pakha hmah khihpi chhôh liata pahlôh vei. Zerikô bei chô liata a taopa hawhta, cha khih bei chô liata chhao tao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zawsua cha a hnohta a ypa Izarei saw zydua chhaota Libnâ tawhta Lakhi khihpi lâ sie ta. Khihpi cha dôhpa ta, a dyuh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Abeipa ta Lakhi khihpi cha Izarei ku liata pie ta, a noh nona liata la ta. Libnâ chô liata a taopa hawhta, Lakhi khihpi chhôh liata a ypa chyhsa zydua zaozi ta thie khai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Keze bei Hôrâ cha Lakhi khihpi bao awpa ta khy ta. Zawsua ta ano nata a sahlaozy cha pakha hmah pahlôh leipa ta thie khai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zawsua nata Izarei saw zydua cha Lakhi tawhta Ekalaw khihpi lâ sie ei ta. Khihpi cha dôhpa ta, a dyuh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cha noh ta khihpi cha la ei ta, zaozi ta ama pahleipadia haw. Lakhi chô liata a taopa hawhta, cha noh ta Ekalaw khihpi liata a ypa chyhsa zydua zaozi ta a thie khai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zawsua nata Izarei saw zydua cha Ekalaw tawhta Hebraw khihpi lâ khy ei ta, khihpi cha a dyuh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hebraw khihpi cha la ei ta, khihsawzy nata a khih bei nata a khichapeihzy liata a ypa chyhsa zydua zaozi ta thie ei ta. Ekalaw chô liata a taopa hawhta Hebraw khihpi nata a chhôh liata a ypa chyhsa zydua a pahleipadia khai ha ei. Pakha hmah pahlôh vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta Zawsua nata Izarei saw zydua cha Debi khihpi lâ a lie ei ta, khihpi cha a dyuh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khihpi nata a khih bei nata a khichapeih zydua la ei ta. Zaozi ta a dyuh ei ta, a chhôh liata a pahrâpa chyhsa zydua ama thie khai haw. Pakha hmah pahlôh vei. Libnâ nata a khih bei chô liata nata Hebraw chô liata a taopa hawhta, Debi nata a khih bei chô liata chhao tao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Zawsua ta râh zydua, tlâh râh, Neke râh, bypi râh nata pâdawhpa râhzy pahnie khaipa ta, ama bei zydua thie khai ta, pakha hmah pahlôh vei. Abeipa , Izarei Khazohpa biepiepa hawhta, husona a hneipa maih a pahleipadia khai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Zawsua ta Kâdesbânia tawhta Kâza taihta pahnie ta, Kôse râh zydua chhao, Kibiô taihta a pahnie khai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Abeipa , Izarei Khazohpa ta Izarei cha â dyuhkheipa vâta, cha bei zydua nata ama râhzy cha Zawsua ta ei kha ta a la khai thei ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta Zawsua cha a hnohta a ypa Izarei saw zydua chhaota Kilkal liata riehmo lâ a lie ha ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izarei ta pahniena a topa thâtih cha, Hâzaw bei Zabi ta a thei nahta, Mâdô bei Zôbâ, Simrô bei, Akasâ bei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />maw lâta tlâh râh beizy, Chinerô chho lâta Arabâ beizy, bypi râh beizy, notla lâta Dôrâ beizy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nochhi nata notla lâta a ypa Kâna mozy, tlâh râh liata a ypa Amawri mo, Perizi mo, Zebu mo nata Mizpâ râh Hâmaw tlâh ry liata a ypa Hivi mozy lâta chyhsa tuah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cha beizy cha ama pheisaih zydua chhaota chyhsa hluhpi, tilaipi kiah liata sadi zie tlai ta hluhpa ta, arâzy nata talailih hluhpi chhaota pua ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beizy cha ama pheisaih zydua pahlyhpa ta Izarei a dyuh awpa ta pua ei ta, Merô tipo liata a riepakhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta, “Âmo kha chi khah y. Mylâ tahmâ ti heta âmo cha thie chiehpa ta Izarei ku liata ei pie aw ei. Ama arâ chazawzy chhawh aw chi ta, ama talailihzy mei ta na rao khai aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zawsua nata a pheisaih zydua ta âmo cha eikhapi ta Merô tipo liata pua thlupa ta, a dyuh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abeipa ta âmo cha Izarei ku liata pie ta, Izarei sawzy ta thie ei ta, Sidaw Rônahpa nata Mirephôthami nata nochhi lâta Mizpâ saikao taihta a chadai ei ta, pakha hmah pahlôh leipa ta ama thie khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abeipa ta bie a piepa hawhta, Zawsua ta ama chô liata tao ta, ama arâ chazawzy chhawh ta, ama talailihzy mei ta rao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cha nona chata Zawsua cha a lie ta, Hâzaw khihpi la ta, a khih bei cha zaozi ta thie ta. Kha hlâta cha Hâzaw cha, a chheipâh khinarâh zydua hry liata khihpi chaipa a châ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hâzaw khihpi liata a ypa chyhsa zydua cha zaozi ta thie khai ei ta, tlokhuh ama pahleipadia khai haw. Husona a hneipa pakha hmah pahlôh veih ei. Zawsua ta Hâzaw khihpi cha mei ta a rao haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cha beizy khihpizy nata ama bei zydua cha, Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi biepiepa hawhta, Zawsua ta la khai ta, zaozi ta âmo cha chhawhsao ta, a pamua ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zawsua ta mei ta a raopa Hâzaw khihpi tah leipa ta, tlâh byuhpa liata khihpi padua chiehpazy cha, Izarei ta khih kha hmah mei ta rao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha khihpizy hraona sôh zydua nata sahrohzy cha, Izarei sawzy ta hraona sôh châta a la ei ta, chyhsapa deikua cha ama pahleipadia khaina taihta zaozi ta thie ei ta, husona a hneipa khâpa hmah pahlôh veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abeipa ta a chakaotuhpa Mawsi hnohta bie a piepa hawhta, Mawsi ta Zawsua cha biepie pachhuah ta, cha hawhna chata Zawsua ta a tao lymâ. Abeipa ta Mawsi bie a piepa zydua a tao leipa y vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua ta Kâna râh zydua cha la khai ta. Tlâh râh, Neke râh, Kôse râh zydua, bypi râh, Arabâ râh, Izarei tlâh râh nata ama bypi râhzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Seirâ Tlâh a kaw dypa Hâlâ Tlâh nata Hâmaw Tlâh ry Lebanaw saikao liata a ypa Bâlâkadâ taihta la khai ta. Ama bei zydua patu ta, a thie khai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cha beizy cha Zawsua ta bohpi â vaw dyuhpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kibiô liata a pahrâpa Hivi mo tah leipa ta cha, Izarei sawzy nata aryhna a taopa khihpi y veih ei. A dyuhpa ta lapa sai a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi bie a piepa hawhta, Zawsua ta âmo cha zawngiahna hnei leipa ta, tlokhuh pahleipadia ta a pamua khai nawpa ei ta, Abeipa ta ama palôh kuh pachhasa ta, Izarei a padyuhsapa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cha daihti liata Zawsua cha sie ta, Anâki mo cha tlâh râh tawhta chhawh pathlah ta. Hebraw tawhta zy, Debi tawhta zy, Anabi tawhta zy, Zudâh tlâh râh zydua tawhta nata Izarei tlâh râh zydua tawhta a chhawh pathlah khai ha ei. Zawsua ta Anâki mo nata ama khihpizy a pahleipadia khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izarei sawzy râh liata Anâki mo pakha hmah y khao veih ei. Kâza khih, Kâthâ khih nata Asadô khihzy lia deita ta a chyhta ama y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta a reipa zydua hawhta, Zawsua ta Kâna râh zydua la khai ta, ama chi apachhaihnazie hawhta ama ryuto râh a pie chyu ei. Chatanachata adyuhna pai ta, râh cha thlalôhpa ta y ha ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezy he Zawdâh haosâ nochhi lâta Anaw saikao tawhta Hâmaw Tlâh taihta nata Arabâ nochhi lâ râh liata beizy Izarei sawzy ta pahnie ei ta, ama râh ama lapazy ama châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hesbaw liata a pahrâpa Amawri bei Sihaw pahnie ei ta. Amawri bei Sihaw cha Anaw saikao chhâna liata a ypa Arôerâ khihpi tawhta ryu a reihpa châ ta, a râh cha Anaw saikao liah khophie taihta nata Kilia râh khophie nata Amawna mo râhri Zabaw chavah taihta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Arabâ nochhi lâta a ypa Chinerô tipo tawhta Arabâ tipo, tipo iahpa taihta nata chho lâta Piskâ baikhaihpazy ry taihta Sihaw râhzy a châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ta Bâsanâ bei Ôkâ chhao pahnie ei ta. Bâsanâ mo cha Rephai chi laibâhpazy châ ei ta, Astarô nata Edarei khihpizy liata a pahrâpa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ôkâ cha Hâmaw Tlâh liata zy, Salekâ khihpi liata zy, Kesurimô nata Mâkâ mo râhri taihta Bâsanâ râh zydua chô liata zy ryureih ta, Hesbaw bei Sihaw râhri taihta Kilia râh khophie chô liata chhao ryu a reihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi nata Izarei sawzy ta âmo cha pahnie ei ta. Ama râhzy cha Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta Rubena chi, Kâdâ chi nata Manase chi khophiezy hnohta ama ryuto châta a pie ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hezy he Zawsua nata Izarei sawzy ta Zawdâh notla lâta ama pahniepa râh beizy ama châ: Lebanaw saikao Bâlâkadâ tawhta Seirâ Tlâh a kaw dypa Hâlâ Tlâh taihta ama pahniepa râhzy cha Zawsua ta Izarei chizy hnohta ama chi apachhaihnazie hawhta ama ryuto châta a pie ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha râhzy cha tlâh râh, bypi râh, Arabâ râh, tlâh baihkhaihpa, râhchawhpa nata Neke râh liata a ypazy châ ei ta, Hiti mo, Amawri mo, Kâna mo, Perizi mo nata Zebu mo râhzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bei a pahniepazy cha Zerikô bei pakha, Bethel kiapâh ta Ai bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zerusale bei pakha, Hebraw bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zarâmu bei pakha, Lakhi bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ekalaw bei pakha, Keze bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Debi bei pakha, Kedâ bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hômâ bei pakha, Aradâ bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Libnâ bei pakha, Adulâ bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mâkedâ bei pakha, Bethel bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tâpuah bei pakha, Hepha bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aphe bei pakha, Saraw bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mâdô bei pakha, Hâzaw bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sirômerô bei pakha, Akasâ bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tânâ bei pakha, Mekidô bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kedesâ bei pakha, Kâmel tlâh liata Zôkania bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nâphatadaw liata Daw bei pakha, Kâlili liata Kôimâ bei pakha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tizah bei pakha, ama zydua ta bei sythôh nata bei kha ama châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zawsua cha vaw machâ ta, pawpi kaw bâ ta. Abeipa ta a hnohta, “Machâ ha chi ta, pawpi kaw bâ chi ta, râh hra cha la awpa hluh chy tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezy he la mâh leipa râhzy a châ: Philistinâ râh zydua nata Kesuri mo râh zydua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izi râh kiapâh liata a ypa Sihaw tawhta maw lâta Ekaraw râhri taihta, Ekaraw cha Kâna râh hawhta pachâpa a châ; Philistinâ bei papangawh ryureina Kâza, Asadô, Askelaw, Kiti nata Ekaraw râhzy nata chho lâta Avimi râh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kâna râh zydua nata Sidaw râh Merâ tawhta Amawri râhri Aphe khih taih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kebâli râh nata nochhi lâta Lebanaw râh zydua Hâmaw Tlâh ry Bâlâkadâ tawhta Hâmathi khih angiana taih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lebanaw tawhta Misrephôthamâ taihta tlâh râh liata a pahrâpa zydua nata Sidaw râh zydua cha, la mâh leipa râhzy a châ. Âmo cha Izarei sawzy hmiakô tawhta papua aw ei na ta, bie ei cha piepa hawhta, ama râhzy cha Izarei sawzy ryuto châta na rai aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta tahmâ chi chakipazy nata Manase chi khophiezy hnohta he râhzy he ryuto châta rai mah y,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Manase chi khophie nata Rubena chi nata Kâdâ chizy cha Zawdâh nochhi lâta Mawsi ta âmo a piepa ryuto râhzy hnei ei ta. Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta he râhzy he âmo a vaw pie ei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anaw saikao chhâna liata a ypa Arôerâ khihpi tawhta saikao liah khophie liata khihpi nata Dibô taihta Medebâ tlâhby râh zydua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hesbaw liata ryu a reihpa Amawri bei Sihaw khihpi zydua Amawna râhri taihta;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kilia râh, Kesuri nata Mâkâ râh, Hâmaw Tlâh zydua nata Bâsanâ râh zydua Salekâ khihpi taihta;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bâsanâ liata Ôkâ khinarâh zydua; ano cha Astarô nata Edarei khihzy liata bei ta a ypa châ ta, Rephai chyhsa a y chhôpa a châ. Cha beizy cha Mawsi ta siehnao ta, a papua ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kesuri mo nata Mâkâ mo deikua cha, Izarei sawzy ta papua veih ei. Kesuri mo nata Mâkâ mo cha tanoh taihta Izarei sawzy hry liata ama y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Livai chi deikua cha Mawsi ta ryuto râh pie vei. Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta a vaw rei hapa hawhta, Livai ryuto awpa cha Abeipa Izarei Khazohpa lâta mei ta hmohlâpazy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rubena chi cha a pho pho ta Mawsi ta ryuto râh pie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama râhri cha Anaw saikao chhâna liata a ypa Arôerâ khihpi tawhta saikao liah khophie liata khihpi nata Medebâ tlâhby râh zydua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hesbaw nata a tlâhby liata khihpi zydua; Dibô, Bamôbâlâ, Bebâlâmeônâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zahâ, Kedemô, Mephâtâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kiriathai, Sibamâ, saikao tlâh liata Zeresahâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bepeôrâ, Piskâ baihkhaihpa, Bezesimô,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tlâhby khihpi zydua nata Hesbaw liata ryu a reihpa Amawri bei Sihaw khinarâh zydua a châ. Bei Sihaw cha, cha râh liata a pahrâpa beithopazy, Midia bei, Evi bei, Reke bei, Zuri bei, Hurâ bei nata Rebâ beizy chhaota Mawsi ta a vaw pahniepa bei kha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beô sawchapawpa pachaothaipa Bâlâma chhao Izarei sawzy ta mohropa ama thiepazy hry liata zaozi ta ama thie ha hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawdâh chavah nata a by zydua cha Rubena pathlazy râh vaw châ ha ta, cha liata khihpizy nata khichapeihzy cha Rubena pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ryu ta ama to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mawsi ta Kâdâ chi chhao a pho pho ta ryuto râh pie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama râh cha Zaze khihpi nata Kilia râh khihpi zydua, Amawna râh khophie, Râbâ nochhi lâta Arôerâ taih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hesbaw tawhta Ramâmize nata Betôni taih, Mâhanai tawhta Debi râh taihta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Saikao liata Beharâ, Benirâ, Sukô, Zaphônâ nata Hesbaw bei Sihaw râh hropazy chhao Kâdâ pathlazy râh châ ta, Zawdâh chavah cha râhri ta hmâpa ta, Zawdâh haosâ nochhi lâta Chinere Tipo mathi lâ chhâna taihta Kâdâ pathlazy râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chazy cha Kâdâ pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama topa khihpizy nata ama khichapeihzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mawsi ta Manase chi khophiezy hnohta ryuto râh pie ta. Manase chi khophiezy hnohta a pho pho ta ryuto râh a rai ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama râh cha Mâhanai tawhta Bâsanâ râh zydua, Bâsanâ bei Ôkâ khinarâh zydua, Bâsanâ râh liata Zairâ kao khihpi zydua chhaota khih sycharu a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kilia râh khophie nata Bâsanâ bei Ôkâ khinarâh liata Astarô nata Edarei chhao âmo râh ta a ô. Chazy cha Manase sawchapawpa Mâkhi pathla khophiezy hnohta a pho pho ta ama ryuto châta piepa râhzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chazy cha Mawsi ta Zawdâh haosâ Zerikô nochhi lâ Môabâ bypi liata ama y nota ryuto châta a raipa râhzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Livai chi deikua cha, Mawsi ta ryuto râh pie vei. Abeipa ta ama hnohta a rei hapa hawhta, Abeipa , Izarei Khazohpa cha ama ryuto a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezy he Izarei sawzy ta Kâna râh liata ryu ta ama topa râhzy a châ. Theihthaipa Eliaza, Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua nata Izarei chizy liata ama pho pawhrâhpazy ta, he râhzy he Izarei sawzy hnohta ama rai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hmâpa ta bie a piepa hawhta, chi chaki nata khophie to awpa râhzy cha nuby a daopa ta raipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chi no nata khophiezy ryuto awpa râhzy cha Mawsi ta Zawdâh haosâ liata pie ha ta, Livai pathlazy deikua cha ama hry liata ryuto râh pie vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zawsi pathlazy tawhta Manase nata Epharai tahpa ta chi no ta ama pua hapa vâta, Livai pathlazy cha râh to hra leipa ei ta, ama pahrâ nawpa châta khihpizy nata ama sahrohzy lao pabâsa nawpa châta khihpi chheipâh sibiepa râhzy piepa tlao ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi bie a piepa hawhta Izarei sawzy ta tao ei ta, râh cha amâ rai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zudâh pathlazy ta Kilkal liata Zawsua lâ a vy ei ta. Keniza chyhsa Zephune sawchapawpa Kâlebâ ta Zawsua hnohta, “ Abeipa ta Kâdesbânia liata Khazohpa chyhsa Mawsi hnohta nâma nata keima kyh liata a reipa kha na pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta râh mohparu awpa ta Kâdesbânia tawhta eina tua nona kha kô sypalihpa châ na ta, ei palôh liata a ypa hawh tlai ta a hnohta bie ei za tlôkhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ei hnohta a siepa ei unawhzy ta zawpi thlah thata pazo ei ta, kei deikua cha pathipalôh tlokhuh ta Abeipa ei Khazohpa pazi na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha noh ta Mawsi ta ei hnohta, ‘Na pathipalôh tlokhuh ta Abeipa ei Khazohpa na pazipa vâta, na phei ta na tlypa râh cha nâ nata na pathlazy ta chhâzaw ryu ta nama to awpa a châ tlai aw,’ tahpa ta bie nâ taih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chavâta tahmâ pachâ tua, cha bie cha râhchawhpa liata Izarei sawzy ama viavi hai nota Abeipa ta Mawsi a chhopa châ ta, cha daihti tawhta reipa ta, Abeipa ta a bie hawhta kô sypalih nata kô pangawh tlai na pahrosa ta, moh tua, tahmâ cha kô sycharie nata kô pangawhpa ei châ ha hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatanachôta Mawsi ta eina tua daihti hawhna khata tahmâ chhao ei tha y chy ta, chariah a dyuh awpa nata puaei awpa ta, eikhano ta tha ei hneipa hawhna khata tahmâ chhao ei hnei chy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chavâta Abeipa ta na pie awpa ta, kha noh ta a reipa tlâh râh he kei na pie mah y. Cha liata Anâki mo y ei ta, ama khihpizy lai ngaita ta, thokhyzy ta dôh khaipa ama châ tahpa chhao, kha noh ta pahno ha chi ta. Abeipa ta na bao aw ta, Abeipa ta a reipa hawhta, âmo cha ei papua aw ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zawsua ta Kâlebâ cha byhnâ awpa ta, Hebraw cha Zephune sawchapawpa Kâlebâ hnohta a ryuto râh châta pie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatanachata Keniza chyhsa Zephune sawchapawpa Kâlebâ cha a pathipalôh tlokhuh ta Abeipa Izarei Khazohpa a pazipa vâta, Hebraw cha tanoh taihta a ryuto râh a châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hebraw cha Kiriathâbâ tahpa ta aw tyhpa châ ta, Arabâ cha Anâki mo hry liata chyhsa rônah chaipa a châ. Chatanachata adyuhna pai ta, râh cha thlahlôhpa ta y ha ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zudâh chi ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa piepa râh cha chho lâta Edômâ râhri nata chho chhâna Zini râhchawhpa taihta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chho lâta ama râhri cha Tilaipi Iahpa chhâna, chho lâ a heihpa lihchakôpa tawhta a thao ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akarâbi lâ kiana chho lâ pangaipa ta sie lymâ ta, Zini tlô ta, Kâdesbânia chho lâta khy ta, Hezrô kei tlô ta, Adarâ lâ khy ta, Kâkâ lâta pako ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azmaw lâta sie ta, Izi chavah liata pua ta, tilaipi cha râhri chhâna a châ. Cha cha chho lâta nama râhri awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nochhi lâ râhri cha Tilaipi Iahpa châ ta, Zawdâh tichhi taih a châ. Maw lâ râhri cha Zawdâh tichhi liata tilaipi lihchakôpa tawhta a thao ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Behôlâ lâta khy ta, Betharâbâ maw lâta sie lymâ ta, Rubena sawchapawpa Bôhâ Lôpanô taih khy ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Râhri cha Akhôrâ Saikao tawhta Debi lâta khy lymâ ta, Kilkal lâ pangaipa ta maw lâta sie ta. Cha cha saikao chho lâta a ypa Adumi mo yna lâ khyna dady liata a ypa a châ. Râhri cha Enâseme tizy chapiapa ta sie lymâ ta, Erôke liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata râhri cha Hinô Sawchapawpa Saikao lâta khy ta, Zebu mo yna chho baikhaihpa taih tlô ta. Zebu he Zerusale a châ. Râhri cha Hinô notla lâta saikao kiapâh ta a ypa tlâh laki lâta khy ta. Cha cha Rephai maw lâta saikao chhâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlâh laki tawhta râhri cha Nephatô chavah hnawh lâta sie ta, Epharaw tlâh khihpizy liata pua ta, Bâlâh lâta chô ta. Bâlâh cha Kiriazeri a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Râhri cha Bâlâh liata pakopa ta notla lâta Seirâ Tlâh lâta sie ta, Ziari Tlâh maw lâ baikhaihpa chapiapa ta sie lymâ ta. Ziari he Keslaw a châ. Cha tawhna chata Beseme lâta chô ta, Timenâ chapiapa ta sie lymâ ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Râhri cha Ekaraw maw lâ baikhaihpa lâta sie ta, Sikarô lâta pako ta, Bâlâh tlâh liata sie lymâ ta, Zabine liata pua ta, tilaipi liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Notla lâta râhri cha Tilaipi Laipa nata a ngiahkâ zydua a châ. Cha cha Zudâh pathlazy châta a pho pho ta ama to awpa râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abeipa ta bie a piepa hawhta, Zawsua ta Zephune sawchapawpa Kâlebâ cha Zudâh pathlazy hry liata tovyuh pie hra ta, a tovyuh cha Kiriathâbâ a châ. Cha cha Hebraw ama tah hra. Arabâ cha Anâki paw a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kâlebâ ta Anâki pathla pathôh, Sesai, Ahimâ nata Tâmai zy cha Hebraw khihpi tawhta papua ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata Debi khih liata a pahrâpazy khyhnao ta. Hlâno ta cha Debi he Kiriasephâ tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kâlebâ ta, “Ahy rai Kiriasephâ a dyuh ta a pahniepa cha ei sawchanô Akasâ lapinô ta ei pahneisa aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kâlebâ unawhpa Kenâza sawchapawpa Ôthane ta Kiriasephâ cha pahnie ta, chatanachata Kâlebâ ta a sawchanô Akasâ cha lapinô ta pahneisa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ôthane lâ a vaw nahta, Akasâ ta a paw liata râh hia awpa ta a vahpa reipasao ta. Akasâ cha alâ tawhta chô ta, Kâlebâ ta a hnohta, “Khâpa na khoh?” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Akasâ ta, “Byhnâ na awpa mah y. Neke râh eina pie ha hnohkua chi cha, tihnawhzy chhao eina pie pâ hra awpa chi ta ei châ haw,” tah ta. Chatanachata Kâlebâ ta Akasâ cha machhua lâta tihnawh nata mathi lâta tihnawhzy pie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hezy he Zudâh chi ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa ryuto râh a châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edômâ râhri daih chho chhâna lâta Zudâh chi khihpizy cha Kâbazelâ, Ederâ, Zaku,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kinâ, Dimônâ, Adadâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kedesâ, Hâzaw, Ithanâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziphi, Tele, Belô,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hâzawhâdatâ, Keriôhezraw, cha cha Hâzaw ama tah hra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amâ, Semâ, Môladâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hâzakâdâ, Hesmaw, Bepele,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hâzasualâ, Bâsebâ, Biziôthia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bâlâh, Imâ, Eza,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eltôlâ, Khesi, Hômâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zikalâ, Mâmanâh, Sâsanâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lebao, Sili, Aina nata Rimaw khihpizy a châ. Khihpi zydua cha khih kih nata khih chaki châ ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Notla bypi râh liata Zudâh khihpizy cha hezy he a châ: Estô, Zôrâh, Âsanâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanô, Enkâni, Tâpuah, Enâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zarâmu, Adulâ, Sôkô, Azekâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Saraimi, Adithai, Kederâ nata Kederôthai, khihpi mia hrawh hleipalih nata ama khichapeihzy;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zenâ, Hadâsâ, Midakâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dilia, Mizpeh, Zôthelâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lakhi, Bôzakâ, Ekalaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kabônâ, Lâmâ, Kili,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kederaw, Bedakô, Nâmâh, Mâkedâ, khihpi mia hrawh hleicharu nata ama khichapeihzy;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Libnâ, Ethâ, Âsâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Iphatâ, Âsanâ, Nezi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keilâh, Akazi nata Mâresâ, khihpi mia chaki nata ama khichapeihzy;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ekaraw nata a khihpizy nata a khichapeihzy;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ekaraw tawhta tilaipi taihta Asadô kiapâh ta a ypa khihpi zydua nata ama khichapeihzy;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Asadô nata a khihpizy nata ama khichapeihzy; Kâza nata a khihpizy nata ama khichapeihzy; Izi chavah taihta nata Tilaipi Laipa nata a ngiahkâzy liata a ypa khihpizy cha notla bypi lâta Zudâh khihpizy a châ khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tlâh râh liata Zudâh khihpizy cha hezy he a châ: Sâmi, Zatia, Sôkô,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Dânâ, Kiriasânâ, cha cha Debi tahpa a châ hra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Anabâ, Estemô, Animâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kôse, Hôlô nata Kilô, khihpi mia hrawh hleikha nata ama khichapeihzy;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Arabâ, Dumâ, Esâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Zani, Betapua, Aphekâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Humtâ, Hebraw ama tah hrapa Kiriathâbâ nata Ziôrâ, khihpi mia chaki nata ama khichapeihzy;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Maônâ, Kâme, Ziphi, Zutâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Zezari, Zôdia, Zanô,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kainâ, Kibia nata Timnah, khihpi miahrawh nata ama khichapeihzy;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hâlahu, Bezu, Kedaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Mârathâ, Bethanô nata Eltekô, khihpi miacharu nata ama khichapeihzy nata
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Kiriaziari ama tah hrapa Kiriabâlâ nata Râbâ, khihpi miano nata ama khichapeihzy cha, Tlâh râh liata Zudâh khihpizy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Râhchawhpa râh liata Zudâh khihpizy cha hezy he ama châ: Bethârabâ, Midi, Sekâkâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Nibâsâ, Alôh Khihpi nata Enkedi khihpi zy châ ei ta, khihpi miacharu y ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Zerusale liata a pahrâpa Zebu mo deikua cha, Zudâh pathlazy ta papua thei veih ei. Chavâta Zebu mo cha tanoh taihta Zerusale liata Zudâh pathlazy nata hmaohkha ta ama pahrâ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zawsi pathlazy tovyuh cha Zerikô tizy nochhi lâta a ypa Zerikô dady Zawdâh chavah tawhta a thao ta, Zerikô tawhta râhchawhpa lâta sie lymâ ta, Bethel tlâh râh lâta khy ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Luzi ama tahpa Bethel tawhta Arakhi râh Atarô chapiapa ta sie lymâ ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />notla lâta Zaphâle râhri lâta chô ta, Behôrô mathi taihta sie ta, Keze lâ chô ta, tilaipi liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chazy cha Zawsi pathla Manase nata Epharai chizy ryuto râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezy he Epharai pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa ryuto râh a châ: Nochhi lâta ama râhri cha Atarôthadâ tawhta Behôrô machhua lâ taihta châ ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />cha tawhna chata râhri cha tilaipi lâta sie ta, maw lâta Mikamethâ y ta, nochhi lâ pakopa ta Tanâsilô lâta sie ta, Zanô nochhi lâta sie lymâ ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zanô tawhta Atarô nata Nârâ lâta chô ta, Zerikô tlô ta, Zawdâh liata a kaw pua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Râhri cha Tâpuah tawhta notla lâta Kânâ chavah taihta sie lymâ ta, tilaipi liata a chhâ. Chazy cha Epharai chi ta a pho pho ta ama topa ryuto râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chazy thota, Manase pathlazy ryuto râhzy hry tawhta Epharai pathlazy châta raopa khihpi nata ama khichapeih zydua â hlao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keze liata a pahrâpa Kâna mo deikua cha, papua veih ei. Chavâta Kâna mo cha tanoh taihta Epharai mo hry liata pahrâ ei ta, rai hriatuhpazy ta taopa ama châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manase cha Zawsi sawchapaw uhtheipa a châpa vâta, hetana heta a tovyuh taopa a châ. Manase sawchapaw uhtheipa cha Mâkhi châ ta, Mâkhi cha Kilia paw a châ. Mâkhi cha pheisaih riahphapa a châpa vâta, Kilia nata Bâsanâ râh cha ano piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Manase pathla hropazy, Abieze pathlazy, Helekâ pathlazy, Asrie pathlazy, Sekhe pathlazy, Hepha pathlazy nata Semidâ pathlazy chhao a pho pho ta ryuto râh piepa ama châ hra. Âmo cha Zawsi sawchapawpa Manase pathla chapawzy a pho pho ta a laichadaipa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Manase pathla Zelôphehâ deikua cha sawchapaw hnei leipa ta, sawchanô sai hnei ta, a sawchanôzy moh cha Mâhlâ, Noâh, Hôkalâ, Milkâ nata Tizah zy ama châ. Zelôphehâ paw cha Hepha châ ta, Hepha paw cha Kilia châ ta, Kilia paw cha Mâkhi châ ta, Mâkhi paw cha Manase a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zelôphehâ sawchanôzy ta theihthaipa Eliaza nata Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua nata chhituhpazy lâ vawh ei ta, ama hnohta, “Eima rilâhpazy hry liata ryuto râh miah pie hra awpa ta Abeipa ta Mawsi kha bie a pie,” tah ei ta. Chatanachata Abeipa pakah bie hawhta, Zawsua ta âmo cha ama paw unawhzy hry liata ryuto râh a pie hra ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawdâh haosâ nochhi lâta Kilia nata Bâsanâ râhzy hleikhô ta, Manase cha ryuto râh su hrawh tlai to ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A chhâpa cha Manase sawchanôzy ta a sawchapawzy hry liata ryuto râh ama hnei hrapa vâta a châ. Kilia râh cha Manase sawchapaw hropazy piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manase râhri cha Asera tawhta a thao ta, Sekhe nochhi lâta a ypa Miamethâ lâta sie ta, cha tawhna chata râhri cha chachâh lâta sie lymâ ta, Entapua mo yna taihta sie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tâpuah râh cha Manase eih châ ta, Manase râhri daih lâta Tâpuah khih deikua cha Epharai pathlazy eih a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Râhri cha chho lâta chô ta, Kânâ vahtiepa tlô ta. Manase khihzy hry liata Epharai khih thokha y hra ta, Manase râhri deikua cha, vahtiepa maw lâta sie ta, tilaipi liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chho lâ Epharai râh châ ta, maw lâ Manase râh a châ. Manase râh cha tilaipi taih tlô ta, maw lâta Asera râh nata a ri ta, nochhi lâta Iskâra râh nata â ri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Iskâra nata Asera râhzy liata chhao Manase ta khihpizy hnei ta, Besia nata a khichapeihzy, Ibalia nata a khichapeihzy, Dôrâ khihsawzy nata a khichapeihzy, Enadô khihsawzy nata a khichapeihzy, Tânâ khihsawzy nata a khichapeihzy nata Mekidô khihsawzy nata a khichapeihzy cha Manase khihpizy châ ei ta, bia thôh a ô.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Châhrasala Kâna mo ta cha râh liata pahrâ khâchâ amâ chhuah hapa vâta, cha khihpizy cha Manase pathlazy ta hnei thei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ama tha a vaw tlô via nahta, Kâna mo cha raihriatuhpa ta tao ei ta, ama zydua ta papua khai khao veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zawsi pathlazy ta Zawsua hnohta, “ Abeipa ta byhnâ miah pie lymâ ta, tahmâ cha chipho lai ngaitapa vaw châ ha pi ta, kheihtazie ta tovyuh miakha deita miah patosa chi ta, ryuto râh su kha deita miah na pie thlâh haw,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zawsua ta ama hnohta, “Cha hawhta maluh hluh ngaitapa chipho châ u la, Epharai tlâh râh cha nama châta a buah tu khiahta cha, nâmo tlai ta Perizi mo nata Rephai mo râh lâ khy u la, ama râhmâhpazy khi nama y nawpa ta kaw pathai muh vy,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zawsi pathlazy ta, “Tlâh râh deita cha eima châta a daih aw vei. Châhrasala bypi râh liata a pahrâpa Kâna mo, Besia nata a khichapeihzy nata Zezari saikao liata a ypa zydua ta thua talailih hnei khai tlôh ei ta,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zawsua ta Zawsi chi Epharai nata Manase pathlazy hnohta, “Chi laipa châ ei chi ta, nama tha chhao tlô ngaita ta, chavâta tovyuh miakha dei hnei aw veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlâh râh khi nâmo eih a châ aw. Râhmâhpa châ hra sala, pathai aw ei chi ta, a râh zydua nama eih a châ aw. Kâna mo cha thua talailihzy hneipa ta ama thatlô kaw hra sala nama papua thei aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izarei zawpi zydua Silô khihpi liata a pahmaoh ei ta, cha liata achhyna poh o parai ei ta. Râh cha ama biehneina ry liata y ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Châhrasala Izarei sawzy hry liata ama ryuto râh rai mâh leipa chi sari y chy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zawsua ta Izarei sawzy hnohta, “Zehôvah, châ pathlatuhpazy Khazohpa ta râh a cha piepa lâ a ngiapa ta, râh cha hnei awpa ta khati taih ma lôhkhô namâ hli chy aw tly?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chi to tawhta chyhsa pathôh chyu a tlyh u la, âmo cha tuah aw na ta, âmo cha sie aw ei ta, râh cha kei chahryh aw ei ta, ama ryuto râh chyu awpa cha roh aw ei ta, kei lâ amâ vaw lie heih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Râh cha su sari ta ama pachhaih aw. Zudâh cha chho lâta a râh liata y aw ta, Zawsi chi cha Maw lâta ama râh liata ama y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Râh cha su sari ta pachhaih aw ei chi ta, nama pachhaihzie cha he su liata kei lâ vaw tlôkhei aw ei chi ta, chatanachata he liata Abeipa eima Khazohpa hmiakô liata nuby ei châ daopa aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Livai chi deikua cha, Abeipa theihthaina raihria cha ama ryuto a châpa vâta, nama hry liata tovyuh hnei aw veih ei. Kâdâ, Rubena nata Manase chi khophie chhao Zawdâh haosâ nochhi lâ liata Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta ama ryuto râh a vaw piepa kha ama to hra,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chyhsazy cha thyu ei ta, sie ha ei ta. Râh thâtih ro awpa ta a siepazy hnohta Zawsua ta, “Râh cha va chahryh u la, a thâtih roh khai u la, kei lâta vaw tlôkhei heih muh vy. He Silô khih liana heta Abeipa hmiakô liata nuby ei châ daopa aw ei,” tahpa ta biepie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chyhsazy cha sie ei ta, râh cha chahryh ei ta. Râh cha su sari ta pachhaih ei ta, su to chhôh liata khih zydua cha châbu liata roh khai ei ta. Cha khai tawhta Zawsua yna Silô khihpi liata riehmo lâ a vaw lie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zawsua ta Silô khihpi liana chata Abeipa hmiakô liata âmo châta nuby a dao ta. Cha liata Zawsua ta Izarei sawzy cha ama chi apachhaihna yzie hawhta râh cha rai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benzami chi ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa râh cha nuby a daopa châ ta, Zudâh pathla nata Zawsi pathlazy likawh râh cha âmo ryuto râh châta raopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw lâta ama râhri cha Zawdâh tawhta a thao ta, Zerikô baikhaihpa siepahliepa ta maw lâta khy ta, notla tlâh râh chapiapa ta khy lymâ ta, Beve râhchawhpa liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata râhri cha Luzi baikhaihpa chapiapa ta chho lâta a sie. Luzi cha Bethel tahpa a châ hra. Cha tawhna chata Atarôthadâ lâta chô ta. Atarôthadâ cha Mathi Behôrô chho lâta tlâh liata a ypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Behôrô chho lâta tlâh tawhna chata râhri cha notla baih lâ tawhta chho lâta pako ta, Zudâh pathlazy khihpi Kiriabâlâ liata a kaw pua. Kiriabâlâ he Kiriaziari tahpa a châ hra. Cha cha notla lâta a ypa râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chho lâta râhri cha Kiriaziari chhâna tawhta a thao ta, notla lâta sie lymâ ta, Nephatô chavah hnawh liata a pua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata râhri cha Hinô Sawchapawpa Saikao dady ta a ypa tlâh thaby lâta chô ta. Cha tlâh cha Rephai Saikao maw lâta a ypa a châ. Râhri cha Zebu mo khihpi chho baikhaihpa chapiapa ta Hinô Saikao lâta chô ta, Erôke liata a pua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata maw lâta pako ta, Enâseme lâta sie ta, Adumi lâ khyna dady ta a ypa Kelilô lâta sie ta, Rubena sawchapawpa Bôhâ Lôpanô lâta chô ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arabâ maw lâta baikhaihpa chapiapa ta Arabâ lâta chô ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />cha tawhna chata râhri cha Behôkalâ maw lâta baikhaihpa chapiapa ta sie lymâ ta, chho lâta Zawdâh chavah za chhâna Tilaipi Iahpa maw lâta lihchakô liata a pua. Cha cha chho lâta râhri a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nochhi lâta râhri cha Zawdâh chavah a châ. Cha cha Benzami pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa ryuto râh ta a ôna chhôh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezy he Benzami chi ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa khihpizy a châ: Zerikô, Behôkalâ, Emekezezi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Betharâbâ, Zemarai, Bethel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Avimi, Pârâ, Ôpharâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kepharâmôni, Ôphani nata Kebâ khihpizy châ ei ta, khihpi miahrawh hleino y ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kibiô, Ramâ, Berô,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizpeh, Kephirâh, Môzâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Reke, Ipelâ, Târalâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zelâ, Helepha, Zebu khihpizy chhao amâ hlao. Zebu cha Zerusale a châ. Kiria­ziari nata Kibi khihpizy chhao a hlao ei ta, khihpi miahrawh hleipalih y ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei. Chazy cha Benzami pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa ryuto râh a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nuby a daopa mianona cha, Simeôna chi ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa ta Simeôna chô liata tlu ta, ama to awpa râh cha Zudâh pathlazy ryuto râh chhôh liata a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khihpi ama topazy cha Bâsebâ, Sebâ, Môladâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hâzasualâ, Balâ, Ezemâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eltôlâ, Bethulâ, Hômâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zikalâ, Bemâkabô, Hâzasusâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlebô nata Saruhe khihpizy châ ei ta, khihpi miahrawh hleithôh y ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khihpi hropa miapalih, Ainâ, Rimaw, Etherâ nata Asanâ khihpizy nata ama khichapeihzy â hlao hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha khihpizy chheipâh liata ama khichapeih zydua, Bâlâbe nata Râmâ chho lâ taihta amâ hlao. Chazy cha Simeôna chi ta a pho pho ta ama topa ryuto râhzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simeôna pathlazy ryuto râh cha Zudâh pathlazy tovyuh tawhta lapa a châ. Zudâh pathlazy tovyuh cha ama châta a kawh tu hapa vâta, Simeôna pathlazy cha Zudâh pathlazy ryuto râh tawhta pachhaihpa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nuby a daopa miathôhna cha Zebulawna pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa ta Zebulawna chô liata tlu ta. Ama ryuto râh cha Sâridâ taih a tlô.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama râhri cha notla lâta sie ta, Maria lâ khy ta, Dâbese kaw hria ta, Zôkania kiapâh liata vahtiepa taih tlô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sâridâ tawhta nochhi lâta noh chhina dady ta sie lymâ ta, Kilôbaw râhri taih tlô ta, Dâberâ lâta pua ta, Zaphia lâta khy ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata nochhi lâta Kahepha nata Ekazi lâta sie lymâ ta, Rimaw liata pua ta, Niah lâ pako ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata râhri cha maw lâta pako heih ta, Hânathô lâta sie ta, Iphatâhe saikao liata a kaw pua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zebulawna khihpizy cha Kâtâ, Nâhalâ, Simrô, Idâlâ nata Bethlehe zy châ ei ta, khihpi miahrawh hleino y ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cha khihpizy nata ama khichapeihzy he Zebulawna pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama topa ryuto râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nuby a daopa miapalihna cha Iskâra pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa ta Iskâra chô liata tlu ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama râh khihpizy cha Zezari, Kesulô, Sune,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hâphari, Siônâ, Anâharâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Râbi, Kisiônâ, Ebeza,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Reme, Enkâni, Enhâdâ nata Bepâze ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Râhri cha Tabaw, Sâzumâ nata Beseme khihpizy taih tlô ta, Zawdâh chavah liata a chhâ. Khihpi miahrawh hleicharu y ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cha khihpizy nata ama khichapeihzy cha Iskâra pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama topa ryuto râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nuby a daopa miapangawhna cha Asera pathlazy ta a pho a pho ta ama to awpa ta Asera chô liata tlu ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama râh khihpizy cha Helkâthâ, Hâli, Bete, Âkasâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Alâmele, Amadi nata Misâ zy a châ. Notla lâta Kâmel nata Sihôlinâ taih tlô ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />cha tawhna chata noh chhina lâta pako ta, Bedekô lâ khy ta, cha tawhna chata Zebulawna nata Iphatâhe saikao maw lâta Betheme nata Nelâ taih tlô ta, chavei lâta Kabu liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata Hebraw, Rehô, Hâmô nata Kânâ zy lâta sie lymâpa ta, Sidaw Laipa taih tlô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata râhri cha Râmâ lâta pako ta, thokhy hneipa Tyre khihpi lâta sie ta, cha tawhna chata Hôsâ lâta pako ta, Akazi râh tilaipi liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Umâ, Aphe nata Rehô khihpizy chhao Asera râh liata a hlao ta, khihpi mia kih nata miano y ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cha khihpizy nata khichapeihzy cha Asera pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama topa ryuto râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nuby a daopa miacharuna cha Nâthalai pathlazy ta a pho a pho ta ama to awpa ta Nâthalai chô liata tlu ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama râhri cha Helepha nata Zanâni thokô laipa tawhta a thao ta, Adamineke nata Zabane zy chahryh laih ta, Zawdâh chavah liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cha tawhna chata râhri cha notla lâ pakopa ta Aznôtabaw lâ sie ta, cha tawhna chata Hôkô lâta sie ta, chho lâta Zebulawna râh kei tlô ta, notla lâta Asera râh kei tlô ta, nochhi lâta Zudâh râh liata Zawdâh chavah liata a chhâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khihpi thokhy a hneipazy cha Zidi, Zerâ, Hâmâ, Rakâ, Chinere,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Adamâ, Râmâ, Hâzaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedesâ, Edarei, Enhâzaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Iraw, Mikadâle, Hôre, Bethanâ nata Beseme zy châ ei ta, khihpi miahrawh hleichaki y ta, khichapeihzy ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cha khihpizy nata ama khichapeihzy cha Nâthalai pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama topa ryuto râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nuby a daopa miasarina cha Dânâ pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama to awpa ta Dânâ chô liata tlu ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama ryuto râh cha Zôrâ, Estaw, Iseme,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sâbi, Aizalô, Zethalâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Elaw, Timnâ, Ekaraw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Elteke, Kibethaw, Bâlathâ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Zehudi, Beneberâ, Kâthârimô,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mezakô nata Rakaw khihpizy nata Zôpâ daih lâta râhzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Dânâ pathlazy cha ama râh awpa zydua ama la khai thei leipa vâta, Lese a kaw dyuh ei ta, la ei ta, zaozi ta pahleipadia ei ta, râh cha ama hnei haw. Cha liata pahrâ ei ta, ama pathlatuhpa Dânâ moh paphaopa ta Lese cha Dânâ tahpa ta a moh ama bi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cha khihpizy nata khichapeihzy cha Dânâ pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama topa ryuto râh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Râh cha ryu ta to awpa ta ama tovyuh chyu raipa a châ khai tawhta, Izarei sawzy ta Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua cha ama hry liata ryuto râh pie hra ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ano ta â hawpa Epharai tlâh râh liata Timnâserâ khihpi cha, Abeipa biepiepa hawhta Zawsua pie ei ta. Khihpi cha paduapathi ta, cha liata a pahrâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chazy cha theihthaipa Eliaza, Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua nata Izarei chizy liata pho pawhrâhpazy ta Silô khihpi liata ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata Abeipa hmiakô ta nuby a daopa ta ryuto râh ama raipazy a châ. Cha hawhna chata râh araina cha ama patlô haw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha Abeipa ta Zawsua hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mawsi hmâpa ta nama hnohta ei rei hapa hawhna khata, abohna khihpizy rao awpa ta Izarei sawzy chho teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chatanachata achhuahna y leipa ta chyhsa a thie pathleipazy tlyma, pahno leipa ta a thie pathleipazy tlyma, abohna khihpizy lâ cha a râ aw ei ta, thisaih phuh latuhpa tawhta namâ bohna su a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chyhsa a thie pathleipa cha abohna khihpizy hry liata miakha lilaw lâ a râ aw ta, khihpi hawka chhikao liata a kei duah aw ta, khihpi machâzy theina liata a thâtih a reih aw. Machâzy ta ama hnohta khih chhôh lâ a chhi aw ei ta, a y nawpa su pie aw ei ta, ama hnohta a pahrâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thisaih phuh latuhpa ta â vaw chadai khiahta cha, cha hlâta ahaona hnei leipa ta a vaih a thie pathleipa a châpa vâta, chyhsa thietuhpa cha a ku liata ama hlâ awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thâtih pachia awpa ta, zawpi hmiakô liata â duah hlâta nata cha daihti liata theihthaipa beichaipa a thi hlâlei abohna khihpi liata a y aw. Cha khai tawhta chyhsa thietuhpa cha â râsaipa khihpi, ano khih lâ a lie heih aw ta, ano o lia tlai â ngia heih aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatanachata Nâthalai tlâh râh Kâlili liata Kedesâ khihpi, Epharai tlâh râh liata Sekhe khihpi nata Zudâh tlâh râh liata Kiriathâbâ khihpizy cha abohna khihpizy châta rao ei ta. Kiriathâbâ cha Hebraw tahpa a châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zawdâh haosâ Zerikô nochhi lâta Rubena chi pahrâna râhchawhpa tlâhby liata a ypa Beze khihpi, Kâdâ chi Kilia râh liata Ramô khihpi nata Manase chi Bâsanâ râh liata Kôlâ khihpizy chhao abohna khihpizy châta ama rao hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha khihpizy cha Izarei sawzy nata ama hry liata chihropa a ypazy châta abohna khihpizy ta raopa châ ta, ahy rai chyhsa a thie pathleipa cha, zawpi hmiakô liata â dua hlâta thisaih phuh latuhpa ku liata a thi lei nawpa ta, cha khihpi lâ cha â râ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Livai chi chhôhkha pawhrâhpazy cha theihthaipa Eliaza nata Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua nata Izarei chizy liata ama pho pawhrâhpazy lâ vawh ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kâna râh Silô khihpi liata ama hnohta, “Eima pahrâ nawpa khihpizy nata eima sahroh tlaih nawpa ta a chaby râhzy miah pie awpa ta, Abeipa ta Mawsi hmâpa ta bie a vaw pie hapa kha châ ta,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chatanachata Abeipa biepiepa hawhta, Izarei sawzy ta ama ryuto râh tawhta, he khihpizy nata a chaby râhzy he Livai chizy ama pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kôhâ pathla phozy to awpa nuby a dao tua chaipa châ ta. Zudâh, Simeôna nata Benzami chi tovyuhzy tawhta khihpi miahrawh hleithôh cha theihthaipa Arawna pathla Livai chizy hnohta ama pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kôhâ pathla hropazy châta nuby a dao heihpa châ ta, Epharai chi, Dânâ chi nata Manase chi khophie phozy tovyuh tawhta khihpi miahrawh ama pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kesao pathlazy châta nuby a daopa châ ta, Iskâra chi, Asera chi nata Nâthalai chi phozy tovyuh tawhta nata Bâsanâ râh liata Manase chi khophie phozy ryuto râh tawhta khihpi miahrawh hleithôh ama pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Merâri pathlazy chhao Rubena chi, Kâdâ chi nata Zebulawna chi tovyuhzy tawhta khihpi miahrawh hleino a pho pho ta ama to hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha khihpizy nata a chabyzy cha, Abeipa ta Mawsi hmâpa ta bie a piepa hawhta, Izarei sawzy ta Livai chizy hnohta nuby a daopa ta ama pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khihpi moh palâsapazy he Zudâh chi tovyuh nata Simeôna chi tovyuh tawhta Livai chizy hnohta ama pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nuby a dao tua chaipa cha Livai chi Kôhâ pho Arawna pathla chô liata tlu ta. Hezy he ama to awpa khihpizy a châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zudâh tlâh râh liata Kiriathâbâ khihpi cha a chaby râhzy chhaota ama pie. Kiriathâbâ cha Hebraw tahpa châ hra ta, Arabâ cha Anâki paw a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khihpi lyuzy nata a khichapeihzy deikua cha, Zephune sawchapawpa Kâlebâ tovyuh châta piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theihthaipa Arawna pathlazy cha lianycheihpazy abohna khihpi Hebraw nata a chabyzy, Libnâ khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zati khihpi nata a chabyzy, Estemô khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hôlô khihpi nata a chabyzy, Debi khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aina khihpi nata a chabyzy, Zutâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, Beseme khihpi nata a chabyzy piepa châ ei ta, chi no tovyuh tawhta khihpi miachaki piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Benzami chi tovyuh tawhta Kibiô khihpi nata a chabyzy, Kebâ khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anathô khihpi nata a chabyzy, Almaw khihpi nata a chabyzy piepa châ ei ta, khihpi miapalih piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Arawna pathla theihthaipazy tovyuh cha a zydua ta khihpi miahrawh hleithôh nata a chabyzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Livai chi Kôhâ pathla hropazy châta nuby a daopa châ ta, Epharai chi tovyuh tawhta khihpizy piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />He khihpizy he piepa ama châ: Epharai tlâh râh liata a ypa lianycheituhpazy abohna khihpi Sekhe nata a chabyzy, Keze khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kibazai khihpi nata a chabyzy, Behôrô khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miapalih piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dânâ chi tovyuh tawhta Elteke khihpi nata a chabyzy, Kibethaw khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aizalô khihpi nata a chabyzy, Kâthârimô khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miapalih piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Manase chi khophie tovyuh tawhta Tânâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, Kâthârimô khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miano piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kôhâ pathla pho hropazy tovyuh cha a zydua ta khihpi miahrawh nata a chabyzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He khihpizy he Livai chi Kesao pathla phozy piepa a châ: Manase chi khophie tovyuh tawhta lianycheituhpazy abohna khihpi Bâsanâ râh liata Kôlâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, Besterâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miano piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Iskâra chi tovyuh tawhta Kisiô khihpi nata a chabyzy, Dâberâ khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zamu khihpi nata a chabyzy, Enkâni khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miapalih piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asera chi tovyuh tawhta Misâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, Abadaw khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Helkâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, Rehô khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miapalih piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nâthalai chi tovyuh tawhta lianycheituhpazy abohna khihpi Kâlili râh liata Kedesâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, Hâmôdaw khihpi nata a chabyzy nata Kâtani khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miathôh piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kesao pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama topa khihpizy cha a zydua ta khihpi miahrawh hleithôh nata a chabyzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Livai chi hropa Merâri pathla phozy cha Zebulawna chi tovyuh tawhta Zônia khihpi nata a chabyzy, Kâratâ khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dimnâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, Nâhalâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miapalih piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Rubena chi tovyuh tawhta Beze khihpi nata a chabyzy, Zahâza khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedemô khihpi nata a chabyzy, Mephâ khihpi nata a chabyzy, khihpi miapalih piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kâdâ chi tovyuh tawhta lianycheituhpazy abohna khihpi Kilia râh liata Ramô khihpi nata a chabyzy, Mâhanai khihpi nata a chabyzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hesbaw khihpi nata a chabyzy, Zaze khihpi nata a chabyzy, a zydua ta khihpi miapalih piepa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chazy cha Livai chi hropa Merâri pathlazy ta a pho pho ta ama topa khihpizy châ ei ta, ama topa cha a zydua ta khihpi miahrawh hleino a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ryuto râh hry liata Livai chi khihpizy cha, khihpi chabyzy chhaota, a zydua ta khih sypalih nata khih charie a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khihpizy ta a chaby liata sahroh tlaihna hnei chyu ei ta, khihpi zydua cha hawhta ama châ khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Abeipa ta Izarei sawzy cha, ama pathlatuhpazy hnohta pie awpa ta bie â vaw taihpa râh zydua pie ta. Chatanachata râh cha hnei ei ta, cha liata pahrâ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Abeipa ta ama pathlatuhpazy hnohta bie â vaw taihpa hawhta, Izarei sawzy cha su to liata apahâna pie ta. Abeipa ta ama chariah zydua ama ku liata a pie khaipa vâ ei ta, ama chariah ahy hmah ama hmiakô liata a duah theipa y veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Izarei phopi hnohta Abeipa bietai phapa zydua miakha hmah a tlô leipa y vei. A zydua ta a tlô paki khai haw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chatawhcha Zawsua ta Rubena mo, Kâdâ mo nata Manase chi khophiezy aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama hnohta, “ Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta bie a cha piepa zydua zyh ei chi ta, kei ta bie ei cha piepa zydua chhao nathlie ei chi ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />noh hluhpi chhôh nama unawhzy siesai leipa ei chi ta, tanoh taihta siesai veih ei chi. Abeipa nama Khazohpa piepazy nama zyh lymâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta ama hnohta bie â taihpa hawhta, nama unawhzy cha apahâna a pie ha ei hih. Chavâta Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta nama ryuto châta râh a cha piepa ei, Zawdâh haosâ liata nama poh ozy lâ a di bâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abeipa chakaotuhpa Mawsi ta bie a cha piepa hawh ei ta, Abeipa nama Khazohpa cha a kyh pachâ ta, a lâpi zydua a chhihpa ta, a biepiepazy zyh ta, ano cha khâchâ patupa ta, nama pathipalôh tlokhuh ta nata nama thlahpa tlokhuh ta ano chakao awpa ta biepiepa nata ryhpazy pakhâta ta nama zyh awpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua ta âmo cha byhnâ awpa ta, pasiesa ta, ama poh ozy lâ a di ha ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manase chi khophie cha Mawsi ta Bâsanâ râh liata ryuto râh pie ta, chi khophie deikua cha Zawsua ta notla lâ Zawdâh haosâ liata ama unawhzy hry liata ryuto râh a pie ei. Ama o lâ a padisa chy ta Zawsua ta âmo cha byhnâ awpa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama hnohta, “Sôh nata thih hluhpi chhaota nama poh ozy lâ a di teh u. Sahrohzy, tâkâzy, ngôhzy, dawhzy, thua nata chysia hluhpi chhaota nama poh ozy lâ a di u la, nama chariahzy nama hraona sôhzy kha nama unawhzy nata a rai teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chatanachata Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase chi khophiezy cha, Kâna râh Silô khihpi liata Izarei sawzy nata a chhaih ei ta, Abeipa ta Mawsi hmâpa ta bie a vaw piepa hawhta, Kilia râh liata ama ryuto râh lâ ama sie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kâna râh Zawdâh kao ama tlô nahta, Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase chi khophiezy cha Zawdâh chavah kiah liata maisâh lai ngaitapa tao ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chyhsazy ta, “Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase chi khophiezy ta Kâna râh tytua Zawdâh kao, Izarei sawzy râh liata maisâh ama tao,” tahpa ta ama reipa Izarei sawzy ta thei ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cha bie cha Izarei sawzy ta ama thei nahta, âmo a dyuh awpa ta Izarei zawpi zydua Silô khihpi liata a hmaohpakhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ta Kilia râh liata a ypa Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase chi khophiezy lâta theihthaipa Eliaza sawchapawpa Phinehâ tuah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnohta chhituhpa pahrawh, Izarei chizy hry tawhta chhôhkha pawhrâh chaipa pakha lymâ ta pasiesa ei ta. Âmo cha Izarei sâh hluhpi hry liata chhôhkha pawhrâh chaipazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase chi khophiezy yna Kilia râh lâ cha sie ei ta, ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Abeipa phopi manôh zydua ta hetana heta ama tah, ‘Khazia Izarei Khazohpa chô liata hmo nama parao? Tanoh he Abeipa nama pazina tawhta tleisai a chhuahpa ta maisâh a tao ei chi ta, tanoh he Abeipa namâ dyuh hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peô su liata moleina kha eima châta a daih vei ma? Abeipa phopi chô liata potlana vaw tlô ta, kha moleina tawhta tahmâ taih eimâ pathai khai to leipa he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khazia tanoh Abeipa tleisai namâ chhuah heih tly? Tanoh Abeipa namâ dyuh khiahta cha, mylâ Izarei zawpi zydua chô liata a pathi a ia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Râh nama topa a pathaih leipa khiahta cha, Abeipa achhyna byureih yna Abeipa râh lâ he vaw chaka u la, eima hry liata râh vaw hnei hra teh u. Anodeikua Abeipa eima Khazohpa maisâh dei leipa ta maisâh hropa taopa ta Abeipa namâ dyuh awpa châ leipa ta, keimo chhao miah namâ dyuh awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zerâ sawchapawpa Âkhâ ta pahleipadia awpa hmozy kyh liata biepiepa a paraopa vâta, Izarei zawpi chô liata hiehâhna a vaw tlôpa kha a thei thlâh ha veih ei chi ma? A paraona vâta ano deita a leidia leipa kha,’” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase chi khophiezy ta Izarei pho hyutuhpazy cha a chhy ei ta, ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Zehôvah, khazohzy Khazohpa! Abeipa , khazohzy Khazohpa! Ano ta pahno ta, Izarei chhao ta pahno mawh sy! Eima maisâh taopa he Abeipa a dyuhpa tlyma, a rei a ngiah leipa tlyma a châ khiahta cha, tanoh he miah pahlôh khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abeipa eima pazipa tawhta tleisai nawpa ta eima châta maisâh a taopa eima châ khiahta nata cha liata raopa hlâna tlyma, niepa hlâna tlyma, aryhna hlâna atheihna tlyma hlâ nawpa ta a taopa eima châ khiahta cha, ano Abeipa tlai ta viari miah thô mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Châhrasala cha hawhta châ vei. Eima chipa vâta a taopa tlao eima châ. Chhâ vaw y awpa liata nama pathlazy ta eima pathlazy hnohta, ‘Nâmo nata Abeipa Izarei Khazohpa cha khâpa azaona ma nama hnei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Abeipa ta Zawdâh he nâmo nata keimo likawh râhri châta rao ha ta, chavâta nâmo Rubena pathlazy nata Kâdâ pathlazy saih u, Abeipa liata tovyuh hnei hra veih ei chi,’ ama vaw tah pathlei aw tahpa eima chipa vâta a châ. Nama pathlazy ta eima pathlazy cha Abeipa a chhy khao lei awpa ta ama tao thei mâh tâh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chavâta, ‘Maisâh tao ei suh u, raopa hlâna châta nata atheihna châta châ leipa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />keimo nata nâmo nata keimo hnôhlâ ta eima pathlazy likah liata pahnokheituhpa châ aw ta, chatanachata eima raopa hlânazy, atheihnazy nata aryhna hlânazy ta Abeipa cha a hmiakô liata chakao thei aw pi ta, chhâ vaw y awpa liata nama pathlazy ta eima pathlazy hnohta, “ Abeipa liata tovyuh hnei veih ei chi,” ama tah lei nawpa ta,’ tahpa ta eima taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chavâta hetana heta eima pachâ: Chhâ vaw y awpa liata keimo hnohta tlyma, eima pathlazy hnohta tlyma, cha bie cha ama rei tita, keimo ta, ‘Nathlie teh u, miah pathlatuhpazy ta Abeipa maisâh ama taozie he raopa hlâna awpa nata atheihna awpa châ vei, keimo nata nâmo likah ta pahnokheituhpa châta a châ,’ eima tah nawpa ta, a taopa eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abeipa a dyuh chachei leipa pi ta, Abeipa eima pazipa tawhta tleisai tiarâh ma pi. Abeipa achhyna byureih hmiakô liata Abeipa eima Khazohpa maisâh tah leipa ta, raopa hlâna châta tlyma, niepa hlâna châta tlyma, atheihna châta tlyma, maisâh tao cheita ma pi,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Theihthaipa Phinehâ nata a hnohta a siepa zawpi chhituhpa Izarei pho hyutuhpazy ta Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase pathlazy bie reipa cha ama thei nahta, a ly kaw ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Theihthaipa Eliaza sawchapawpa Phinehâ ta Rubena pathlazy, Kâdâ pathlazy nata Manase pathlazy hnohta, “ Abeipa eima hry liata a y tlai tahpa tanoh eima pahno haw. Abeipa châta nama ngâchhihna nama pahlei leipa vâta, tahmâ he Abeipa ku tawhta Izarei sawzy nama pachha haw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chatanachata theihthaipa Eliaza sawchapawpa Phinehâ nata chhituhpazy cha, Rubena pathlazy nata Kâdâ pathlazy pahrâna Kilia râh tawhta Izarei pathlazy yna Kâna râh lâ a lie ei ta, bie cha kei tlôkhei ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cha biezy chata Izarei sawzy cha palysa kaw ta. Chatanachata Izarei sawzy cha Khazohpa reithai ei ta, Rubena pathlazy nata Kâdâ pathlazy a dyuh ta, ama pahrâna râh parao awpa kyh reih khao veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Rubena pathlazy nata Kâdâ pathlazy ta, “He he Abeipa cha Khazohpa a châ tlai na tahpa eima likah liata Pahnokheituhpa a châ,” tah ei ta, maisâh cha Pahnokheituhpa tahpa ta a moh ama bi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Izarei cha ama chheipâh chariah zydua tawhta apahâna pie ta, bohpi a châ tawhta, Zawsua chhao cha vaw machâpa ta kô uhthei ngaitapa vaw châ ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zawsua ta Izarei machâ, chhituhpa, ryureituhpa nata hyutuhpa zydua awpakhy ta, ama hnohta, “Kei cha machâ ha na ta, kô uhthei ngaitapa ei châ ha hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta nâmo vâta he phopi zydua chô liata a taopa zydua nama hmô khai. Abeipa nama Khazohpa ano tlai ta a châ dyuhpa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachâ teh u, phopi pahnie mâh leipazy nata kei tlai ta ei chhawh pathlah hapa, Zawdâh tawhta notla lâ Tilaipi Laipa tlôna taihta phopizy râh cha, nama chizy ryuto râh châta ei cha pie ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta âmo cha nama hmiakô liata papua aw ta, nama hmô pha leipa lâ a to khai aw ei. Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta nama hnohta a reipa hawhta, ama râh cha nama hnei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chavâta Mawsi ryhpa châbu liata ropa zydua riahphapa ta zyh u la, tao teh u. Chachâh lâ tlyma, chavei lâ tlyma, tleisai cheita khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nama hry liata a ypa phopizy a kao leipa u la, ama khazohzy moh pado khuh vy. Ama khazohzy moh ta bie a taih leipa u la, cha khazohzy cha chakao leipa u la, a chhy khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tanoh taihta nama taopa hawhna heta, Abeipa nama Khazohpa deita khâchâ nama patu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abeipa ta chi laipa nata thatlôpazy nama hmiakô tawhta papua khai ta, nama hmiakô liata a duah theipa tanoh taihta ahy hmah y veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta bie châ taih ei ta, ano tlai ta nâmo châta â dyuhpa vâta, nâmo chyhsa pakha ta chyhsa sâh kha namâ chadaipai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chavâta a phapa ta a sohsi u la, Abeipa nama Khazohpa cha kyhpachâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnôh lâ a heihpa ta, phopi laibâhpa nama hry liata a pahrâpazy a zaokhipa ta, a hnei pahlao u la, nama o cha kiah ei sala, ama o nama kiah khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta phopizy he nama hmiakô tawhta papua khao aw vei tahpa pahno muh vy. Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta râh pha ngaitapa a cha piepa tawh eina heta nama leidia khai hlâlei, âmo cha nama châta khoheih nata aphyh châ aw ei ta, nama kâ châta tuna chôchahrei châ aw ei ta, nama mokhaoh châta ahloh ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tahmâ cha khizaw zydua siezie hawhta ei sie hra daihti liahsa â hnia haw. Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta nâmo kyh liata bie pha a vaw rei hapa zydua kha, a patlô leipa miakha hmah y vei tahpa nama pathipalôh tlokhuh ta nata nama thlahpa tlokhuh ta nama pahno. Nama chô liata vaw tlô khai ta, a tlô leipa miakha hmah y vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta nama hnohta hmo phapa a reipa zydua nama chô liata a vaw tlô khaipa hawhta, a biepiepazy nama parao khiahta deikua cha, Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta râh phapa a cha piepa tawh ei ta a cha pahleipadia khai hlâlei ei cha, Abeipa ta hmo pha leipazy nama chô liata a vaw patlôsa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abeipa nama Khazohpa ta bie a cha piepa ei, a biehrai paraopa ta, khazoh hropazy pangaipa ta âmo cha chakaopa ta namâ chhy khiahta cha, nama chô liata Abeipa pathi ia aw ta, râh phapa a cha piepa tawhna ei heta thlai nama leidia aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zawsua ta Izarei chi zydua cha Sekhe liata pahmaoh ta, Izarei machâzy, chhituhpazy, ryureituhpazy nata hyutuhpazy awpakhy ta. Khazohpa hmiakô liata a luah chyu ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zawsua ta zawpi zydua hnohta, “Zehôvah, Izarei Khazohpa ta hetana heta a tah: ‘Châ pathlatuhpazy, Abarahâ nata Nâhaw paw Terâ tlai chhao kha, hlâno cha Ufrâti chavah khô lâ râh liata pahrâ tyh ei ta, khazoh hropazy ama chakao tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nâmo châ pathlatuhpa Abarahâ kha Chavah khô lâ tawhta a vaw chhi na ta, Kâna râh chhôh zydua ei chhihtha. A chipathla papôh na ta, Aisika kha ei pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aisika hnohta Zakaw nata Esaw pie na ta. Esaw cha a ryuto châta Seirâ tlâh râh ei pie. Zakaw nata a sawzy cha Izi râh lâ zu ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chatawhcha Mawsi nata Arawna tuah na ta, Izi râh cha ama hry liata ei patlôsapa potlana khata hrie na ta, cha khai tawhta ei châ chhi papua ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Châ pathlatuhpazy Izi râh tawhta a chhi papua ei na ta, tilaipi nama vaw tlô. Izi mo ta talailihzy nata arâ pheisaihzy chhaota châ pathlatuhpazy cha Tilaipi Saihpa taih a vaw chadai ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Châ pathlatuhpazy ta Abeipa pado ei ta, nâmo nata Izi mo likawh liata zohna vaw soh ta, Izi mo cha tilaipi ta pavaosa ta, a pamôh khai ha ei. Izi râh liata ei hmotaopa kha nama mo tlai ta hmô ta. Râhchawhpa liata bohpi nama y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“‘Cha khai tawhta Zawdâh haosâ liata a ypa Amawri râh lâ ei châ chhi ei. Châ vaw dyuh ei ta, âmo cha nama ku liata ei cha pie ei. Chatanachata ama râh hnei ei chi ta, âmo cha nama hmiakô tawhta ei pahleipadia ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zipô sawchapawpa Môabâ bei Bâlâka vaw thyu ta, Izarei cha a vaw dyuh ta, chhie cha sapa awpa ta Beô sawchapawpa Bâlâma hnohta chyhsa tuah ta, a paawsa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Châhrasala Bâlâma bie nathlie khoh va na. Chavâta nama châta byhnâ tlao aw ta, Bâlâka ku tawhta ei cha pachha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta Zawdâh chaka ei chi ta, Zerikô nama tlô. Zerikô chyhsazy ta châ vaw dyuh ei ta, Amawri mo, Perizi mo, Kâna mo, Hiti mo, Kikâsi mo, Hivi mo nata Zebu mozy chhao ta châ dyuh hra ei ta, châhrasala âmo cha nama ku liata ei cha pie ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nama hmia lâta kheihpangiah tuah na ta, cha chata âmo cha nama hmiakô tawhta a chadai ta, Amawri bei pano â chadaipai ha ei. Nama zaozi ta tlyma, nama libaw ta tlyma nama pahniepa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nama hriapasa leipa râh nata nama padua leipa khihpizy cha pie ei na ta, chazy liata pahrâ ei chi ta, nama lo leipa kre sadô nata ôli sadô theizy nama nie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“‘Chavâta Abeipa cha chi u la, hmeiseihpa nata â do ngaitapa ta ano cha chakao muh vy. Châ pathlatuhpazy ta Chavah haosâ nata Izi râh liata ama chakao tyhpa khazohzy kha thy khai u la, Abeipa chakao muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abeipa chakaopa cha a pha lei awpa hawhta nama pahno khiahta cha, tanoh he ahy ma nama chakao aw, a tlyh teh u. Châ pathlatuhpazy ta Chavah haosâ liata ama chakao tyhpa khazohzy kha ma, nama pahrâ haipa râh Amawri mo khazohzy he ma, a tlyh teh u. Kei nata ei chhôhkha ta la Abeipa eima chakao aw,’” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zawpizy ta, “Zehôvâh Khazohpa siesaipa ta khazoh hropazy chakao cheita aw ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abeipa eima Khazohpa, ano tlai cha keimo nata miah pathlatuhpazy Izi râh seichâna o tawhta miah a kaw chhi papua ta, eima mohmô liata ngiana rônah ngaitapazy taopa ta, eima siena maih nata phopi eima chatôhna zydua liata miah pabohsatuhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abeipa ta phopi zydua, cha râh liata a pahrâpa Amawri mo chhao, eima hmiakô tawhta a papua khai ei. Chavâta keimo chhao Abeipa eima chakao aw, ano cha eima Khazohpa a châ,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Châhrasala Zawsua ta zawpi hnohta, “ Abeipa chakao thei aw veih ei chi. Ano cha Khazoh pathaihpa châ ta, hiatlia a pasapa Khazohpa a châ. Nama paraonazy nata nama moleinazy a ngiahthai aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abeipa siesaipa ta râh hropa khazohzy nama chakao khiahta cha, nama chô liata hmo phapa a vaw tao hapa chhao ta, châ heihnaohpa ta hmo pha leipa ta cha thô aw ei ta, a cha pahleipadia aw ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zawpizy ta Zawsua hnohta, “Châ vei, Abeipa khâchâ eima chakao aw,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zawsua ta zawpi hnohta, “ Abeipa chakao awpa ta namâ tlyhpa kyh liata pahnokheituhpazy cha nâmosasyh tlai nama châ,” tah ta. Âmo ta, “Pahnokheituhpazy eima châ,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zawsua ta, “Chata a châ khiahta cha, nama hry liata chihropa khazoh a ypazy kha thy khai u la, Abeipa Izarei Khazohpa lâta nama pathipalôh pahei teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zawpizy ta Zawsua hnohta, “ Abeipa eima Khazohpa chakao aw pi ta, a bie eima zyh lymâ aw,” tah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua ta, cha noh liata zawpi hnohta bie hraih ta, âmo châta bieraopa nata pachianazy Sekhe liata tao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zawsua ta cha biezy cha Khazohpa ryhpa châbu liata roh ta, alô laipa la ta, Abeipa supathaihpa kiapâh ta ôkâ tho ry liata bô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zawsua ta zawpi zydua hnohta, “Moh teh u, he alô he miah pahnokheituhpa a châ aw. Abeipa ta eima hnohta bie a reipa zydua thei khai ta, chavâta nâmo châ pahnokheituhpa a châ aw. Chataleipatala nama Khazohpa cha namâ paphasai pathlei aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chatanachata Zawsua ta zawpizy cha ama ryuto râh chyu lâta pasiesa ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta Nunâ sawchapawpa Zawsua, Abeipa chakaotuhpa cha kô 110 uhtheipa ta thi ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kâsi tlâh maw lâta Epharai tlâh râh Timnâserâ liata a ryuto râh liata ama pabu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zawsua hro chhôh nata Zawsua hlâta a hro parei viapa, Abeipa ta Izarei châta hmo a taopa zydua a pahnotuhpa machâzy hro chhôh liata cha, Izarei sawzy ta Abeipa ama chakao lymâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ta Izi râh tawhta Zawsi ru ama kaw phaopa kha, Sekhe khihpi liata Zakaw ta Sekhe paw Hamô sawzy liata tâkâ za kha ta a chaleipa su liata pabu ei ta. Cha cha Zawsi pathlazy ryuto râh a châ pâ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Arawna sawchapawpa Eliaza cha thi ta, a sawchapawpa Phinehâ hnohta a ryuto châta ama piepa Epharai tlâh râh Kibia khih liata ama pabu.
  </para>
</usx>
